-- הסכם קיבוצי ליישום רפורמת "אופק חדש" — ההסכם הזמני (10.9.2007): the
-- collective agreement that started the reform, an interim agreement in
-- force from 1.9.2007 to 15.12.2007 while the comprehensive agreement was
-- negotiated. Who it covers and how the reform spreads over the schools;
-- the definitions; who moves and who may choose not to; the new work week
-- of academic teachers (the frontal, individual and stay hours, the mother
-- teacher, part time, further activities, substitution and school
-- activities, the hour value, the global arrangement, the size of the
-- position); the new salary structure (tables, placement, seniority,
-- promotion and its quotas, the role allowances that go on); the salary
-- conversion of existing academic and non-academic teachers, principals,
-- first and other deputies and counsellors; the principals' and deputies'
-- week, tables and term; the counselling allowance; the update of the old
-- salary by the public-sector wage agreement; salary consolidation; the
-- determining salary of a budgetary pension; the attendance clock; earlier
-- agreements, industrial peace, entry into force and expiry, the
-- transitional declaration, transparency, and the steering and supreme
-- follow-up committees.
--
-- It PRECEDES the base agreement of 25.12.2008, so it imports none of it:
-- it is encoded as written, and where the base agreement later replaced
-- one of its rules, that is the base agreement's to say. Names the base
-- agreement uses for the same thing are reused here (`status`, `the role
-- rate`, `A, the converted pay`, `the counselling rate`, …), so the two can
-- be lined up. The annexes it names — the work-week tables א–ב, the salary
-- tables ג–ו, ח–י and יא–יד, the undertaking ז and the declaration טו — are
-- not in this document; each is a named input where a rule uses it. The
-- trips agreement of 8.9.1998 (הסתדרות המורים) is imported for §30, and the
-- public-sector framework agreement of 17.4.2008 — the general wage
-- agreement §76 waits on (convention instruments.general-wage-agreement) —
-- for §76(ג); the other instruments it cites that are not encoded (the salary
-- consolidation agreement, the Director-General's circulars, the pensions
-- law) are named inputs. The takanon is encoded,
-- but its §1.29, whose seniority §27 applies, cannot be imported by its
-- name "1.29" (the compiler reads the dot as a path) and has no link under
-- another name, so the seniority it counts is an input here too.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`
IMPORT `2008-04-17_framework-agreement_public-sector`

-- Time is counted in SALARY MONTHS where the text speaks of a salary
-- ("במשכורת חודש ינואר 2008"): `the salary month` y m is month m of year y.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

-- The day the reform starts, and the school year 5768 (התשס"ח) it starts in.
`1 September 2007` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007
`15 December 2007` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 12 2007

§ `ההסכם הזמני ליישום רפורמת אופק חדש — 10.9.2007`


-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration number; no rule.

@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the signing date` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 9 2007

-- akn:preamble/p3 The first party, the government of Israel for the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 A recital: the government's decision on a reform of the education system.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the parties agreed to cooperate in applying the reform in primary and junior high schools.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the parties agreed to negotiate the changes to the existing agreements the reform needs.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the "outline of principles" signed on 16.5.07.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties agreed to negotiate toward a collective agreement anchoring all their agreements.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the negotiation could not end before the school year 5768 opened.

-- The recital fixes this agreement's term: an interim agreement in force
-- from 1.9.07 to 15.12.07, while a comprehensive agreement is negotiated,
-- to be signed by 15.12.07 and in force retroactively from 1.9.07. Both
-- days are in the term (conventions dates.start and dates.end).
@ref akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the interim agreement's term` d IF
    d `is on or after` `1 September 2007` AND d `is on or before` `15 December 2007`

#ASSERT `in the interim agreement's term` `15 December 2007`
#ASSERT NOT `in the interim agreement's term` (DATE_FROM_DMY 16 12 2007)

-- akn:preamble/p16 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§ `א. כללי`

-- akn:part_1 The heading of part A (general); its articles follow.

§§ `1`

@ref akn:art_1
DECLARE `part of the agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the preamble`
    `the body of the agreement`
    `an annex`

GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the agreement` `the preamble` AND `binds as the agreement` `an annex`

§§ `2`

@ref akn:art_2
DECLARE `form of a word` IS ONE OF masculine, feminine, singular, plural

GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word written in one form reads in another` masculine feminine FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a word written in one form reads in another` singular plural TRUE

§ `ב. תחולת ההסכם`

-- akn:part_2 The heading of part B (application); its article follows.

§§ `3`

DECLARE `scale` IS ONE OF
    `the teaching employees' scale`
    `the school principals' scale`
    `another scale`

DECLARE `school kind` IS ONE OF
    `a primary school`
    `a junior high school`
    `a special-education school`
    `another school`

@desc An employee, as far as §3 asks who the agreement covers.
DECLARE `employee under section 3` HAS
    `ranked on`                       IS A `scale`
    `in the civil service`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in`                     IS A `school kind`

-- §3: the employees ranked on the teaching employees' scale or the school
-- principals' scale, in the civil service, in primary and junior high
-- schools — not special-education schools, but those teaching
-- special-education classes in a primary or junior high school that is not
-- one are in ("עובדי הוראה" from here on); non-academic teachers are in as
-- the agreement details.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee under section 3`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement covers` e IF
        e's `in the civil service`
    AND (NOT e's `ranked on` EQUALS `another scale`)
    AND (e's `employed in` EQUALS `a primary school` OR e's `employed in` EQUALS `a junior high school`)

`a teacher of a special-education school` MEANS
    `employee under section 3` WITH
        `ranked on`            IS `the teaching employees' scale`
        `in the civil service` IS TRUE
        `employed in`          IS `a special-education school`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement covers` `a teacher of a special-education school`

§ `ג. יישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:part_3 The heading of part C (applying the reform); its articles follow.

§§ `4`

-- §4: the reform applies gradually to all teaching employees from
-- 1.9.2007; it is complete no later than 1.9.2012, provided the
-- comprehensive agreement is signed.
@ref akn:art_4
`the reform applies from` MEANS `1 September 2007`
`the reform is complete by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012

GIVEN `the comprehensive agreement is signed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the completion date binds` `the comprehensive agreement is signed` IF
    `the comprehensive agreement is signed`

§§ `5`

-- §5: from 5768 (from 1.9.2007) the reform applies first in the schools on
-- the list the Ministry drew up, and to every new teacher.
@ref akn:art_5
GIVEN `the school is on the Ministry's list` IS A BOOLEAN, `a new teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform applies to the teacher` `the school is on the Ministry's list` `a new teacher` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the reform applies from`
    AND (`the school is on the Ministry's list` OR `a new teacher`)

#ASSERT NOT `the reform applies to the teacher` TRUE FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2007)
#ASSERT `the reform applies to the teacher` FALSE TRUE `1 September 2007`

§ `ד. הגדרות לעניין הסכם זה`

-- akn:part_4 The heading of part D (definitions); its article follows.

§§ `6(א)–(ב) Teaching employee and teacher`

-- akn:art_6 The article's number line; its definitions follow.

-- (א): a teaching employee "כהגדרתו בסעיף 4 לעיל". F-ofek-hadash-founding-
-- 2007-a: §4 defines no one — it says when the reform applies; the
-- definition ("להלן ולעיל – עובדי הוראה") is §3's. The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.misprint): §3's.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a
GIVEN e IS AN `employee under section 3`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee` e IF
    `the agreement covers` e

`the section that coins "עובדי הוראה"` MEANS 3
`the section 6(א) names` MEANS 4
`6(א) names a section that defines no teaching employee` MEANS
    NOT (`the section 6(א) names` EQUALS `the section that coins "עובדי הוראה"`)
#ASSERT `6(א) names a section that defines no teaching employee`

-- (ב): one who teaches pupils aged 6 to 18 in official institutions.
@ref akn:art_6__para_b
GIVEN `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` IS A BOOLEAN, `in official educational institutions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher` `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` `in official educational institutions` IF
    `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` AND `in official educational institutions`

§§ `6(ג) Mother teacher`

@desc Who raises the teacher's children, as far as 6(ג) asks.
DECLARE `parent status` IS ONE OF
    `a mother`
    `a divorced parent with custody by a valid divorce agreement or judgment`
    `a parent in divorce proceedings raising the children alone, by the welfare authorities' confirmation`
    `a widowed parent raising the children alone`
    `another parent`

-- (ג): a position not less than 79%, the mother of a child "עד גיל 14" at
-- the start of the school year, and the parents (ג) names in the same
-- conditions. "עד גיל 14" follows convention thresholds.until: a child
-- under 14. (¶2: an adopted child is a child.)
@ref akn:art_6__para_c akn:art_6__para_c/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
      `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc an adopted child included (¶2)
      status IS A `parent status`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother teacher` `position fraction` `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` status IF
        `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79
    AND `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` `is until` 14
    AND NOT status EQUALS `another parent`

#ASSERT `a mother teacher` 0.79 13 `a mother`
#ASSERT NOT `a mother teacher` 0.78 3 `a mother`
#ASSERT NOT `a mother teacher` 1 14 `a mother`

§§ `6(ד)–(ה) Academic teacher and academic degree`

DECLARE `degree institution` IS ONE OF
    `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`
    `a recognised institution abroad, the degree approved as equivalent`
    `an institution abroad, the degree not approved as equivalent`
    `another institution`

-- (ה): a degree from an institution the Council for Higher Education
-- recognised (section 9 of its law), or from a recognised institution
-- abroad whose degree the evaluation department approved as equivalent.
@ref akn:art_6__para_e
GIVEN i IS A `degree institution`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic degree` i IF
        i EQUALS `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`
    OR  i EQUALS `a recognised institution abroad, the degree approved as equivalent`

-- (ד): a teacher with an academic degree; and, for this agreement only, one
-- on a salary grade equivalent to an academic one, approved by the teaching
-- personnel division or a district's.
@ref akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN degree IS A MAYBE `degree institution`
      `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic teacher` degree `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one` IF
    CONSIDER degree
    WHEN JUST i THEN `an academic degree` i OR `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one`

#ASSERT `an academic teacher` (JUST `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `an academic teacher` (JUST `an institution abroad, the degree not approved as equivalent`) FALSE

§§ `6(ו)–(ח) Certified, senior and uncertified teacher`

-- (ו): a certified teacher holds one of five qualifications.
@ref akn:art_6__para_f
DECLARE `teaching qualification` IS ONE OF
    `a certified or senior certified teacher's certificate from a recognised Israeli teacher-training institution`
    `certification on the strength of reserve examinations`
    `a permanent teaching licence for post-primary education`
    `a licence to practise teaching`
    `a university teaching certificate from Israel`
    `a qualification the clause does not list`

@ref akn:art_6__para_f__subpara_a akn:art_6__para_f__subpara_b akn:art_6__para_f__subpara_c akn:art_6__para_f__subpara_d akn:art_6__para_f__subpara_e
GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a certified teacher` qs IF
    any (GIVEN q YIELD NOT q EQUALS `a qualification the clause does not list`) qs

-- (ז): a senior certified teacher who got the rank by finishing a
-- teacher-training college that gave it, or by a certificate (for the
-- salary grade) given on the strength of in-service training.
@ref akn:art_6__para_g
DECLARE `how the senior rank was got` IS ONE OF
    `finishing studies at a teacher-training college that gave the rank`
    `a certificate for the salary grade, on the strength of in-service training`
    `another way`

@ref akn:art_6__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_g__subpara_2
GIVEN `a senior certified teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, how IS A `how the senior rank was got`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a senior teacher` `a senior certified teacher` how IF
    `a senior certified teacher` AND NOT how EQUALS `another way`

-- (ח): an uncertified teacher has no certificate of certification to
-- teach. F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-b: (ו) counts as certified the holder
-- of a licence ((ג), (ד)) and of a university teaching certificate ((ה)),
-- none of which is a "תעודת הסמכה להוראה"; by the words of (ח) such a
-- teacher is uncertified too. The reading adopted: (ח) is the complement of
-- (ו).
@ref akn:art_6__para_h
GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified teacher` qs IF
    NOT `a certified teacher` qs

GIVEN q IS A `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a certificate of certification to teach` q IF
        q EQUALS `a certified or senior certified teacher's certificate from a recognised Israeli teacher-training institution`
    OR  q EQUALS `certification on the strength of reserve examinations`

GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `uncertified by the words of (ח)` qs IF
    NOT any `is a certificate of certification to teach` qs

`a licensed teacher is both certified and, by the words of (ח), uncertified` MEANS
        `a certified teacher` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)
    AND `uncertified by the words of (ח)` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)
#ASSERT `a licensed teacher is both certified and, by the words of (ח), uncertified`
#ASSERT NOT `an uncertified teacher` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)

§§ `6(ט)–(י) Existing and new teacher`

DECLARE `state on an eve` IS ONE OF
    `taught or managed a school for the Ministry, the year recognised as seniority`
    `on unpaid leave, partial unpaid leave or a sabbatical, as a teaching employee of the Ministry`
    `neither`

-- (ט): one of the conditions held both on the eve of the signing and on the
-- eve of the teacher's own move to the reform; (י): a new teacher is one
-- who is not an existing teacher.
@ref akn:art_6__para_i akn:art_6__para_i__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_i__subpara_2
GIVEN `on the eve of the signing` IS A `state on an eve`, `on the eve of the move` IS A `state on an eve`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teacher` `on the eve of the signing` `on the eve of the move` IF
        (NOT `on the eve of the signing` EQUALS `neither`)
    AND (NOT `on the eve of the move` EQUALS `neither`)

@ref akn:art_6__para_j
GIVEN `on the eve of the signing` IS A `state on an eve`, `on the eve of the move` IS A `state on an eve`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher` `on the eve of the signing` `on the eve of the move` IF
    NOT `an existing teacher` `on the eve of the signing` `on the eve of the move`

#ASSERT `a new teacher` `neither` `taught or managed a school for the Ministry, the year recognised as seniority`
#ASSERT `an existing teacher` `on unpaid leave, partial unpaid leave or a sabbatical, as a teaching employee of the Ministry` `taught or managed a school for the Ministry, the year recognised as seniority`
#ASSERT NOT `an existing teacher` `taught or managed a school for the Ministry, the year recognised as seniority` `neither`

§§ `6(יא)–(יג) Principal, deputy and counsellor`

-- (יא): serves as principal of an official educational institution,
-- appointed under the Director-General's circular on appointing
-- principals; not the principal of a six-year school.
@ref akn:art_6__para_ja
GIVEN `principal of an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `appointed under the Director-General's circular` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a six-year school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a principal` `principal of an official institution` `appointed under the Director-General's circular` `a six-year school` IF
        `principal of an official institution`
    AND `appointed under the Director-General's circular`
    AND NOT `a six-year school`

-- (יב): serves as deputy principal, appointed under the circular on
-- appointing deputies.
@ref akn:art_6__para_jb
GIVEN `deputy of an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN, `appointed under the Director-General's circular` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a deputy principal` `deputy of an official institution` `appointed under the Director-General's circular` IF
    `deputy of an official institution` AND `appointed under the Director-General's circular`

-- (יג): part of the school's educational staff, working in mental health
-- and the wellbeing of pupil, staff and parent, holding a permanent or
-- temporary licence in educational counselling as the Director-General's
-- circular defines one.
@ref akn:art_6__para_jc
GIVEN `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` IS A BOOLEAN, `holds a counselling licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an educational counsellor` `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` `holds a counselling licence` IF
    `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` AND `holds a counselling licence`

§ `ה. יישום ההסכם`

-- akn:part_5 The heading of part E (applying the agreement); its articles follow.

DECLARE `terms of employment` IS ONE OF
    `the reform's terms`
    `the existing agreements`

§§ `7`

-- §7: a new teaching employee is employed on the reform's terms from his
-- first day, even in a school not yet on the list.
@ref akn:art_7
GIVEN `the school is on the list` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of employment`
DECIDE `a new teaching employee's terms` `the school is on the list` IS
    `the reform's terms`

#ASSERT `a new teaching employee's terms` FALSE EQUALS `the reform's terms`

§§ `8`

-- §8: an existing teaching employee in a school where the reform is not
-- yet applied stays under the agreements, arrangements and practices of
-- the eve of the signing, as updated from time to time ("ההסכמים
-- הקיימים"), on pay and the structure of the work week.
@ref akn:art_8
GIVEN `the reform is applied in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of employment`
DECIDE `an existing teaching employee's terms off the list` `the reform is applied in the school` IS
    IF `the reform is applied in the school` THEN `the reform's terms` ELSE `the existing agreements`

§§ `9`

-- §9: one who chose the reform in a reform school and then moved to a
-- school without it stays on the reform's terms he was placed in.
@ref akn:art_9
GIVEN `chose the reform in a reform school` IS A BOOLEAN, `the new school has the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stays under the reform after moving school` `chose the reform in a reform school` `the new school has the reform` IF
    `chose the reform in a reform school`

§§ `10`

DECLARE `existing employee's post` IS ONE OF
    `principal in post`
    `first deputy in post`
    `another existing teaching employee`

DECLARE `choice action` IS ONE OF
    `choose not to move to the reform this school year`
    `choose to move to the reform at the start of a later school year`
    `give written notice of the choice on the Ministry's form`

-- ¶1: an existing teaching employee, save a principal and a first deputy,
-- may choose not to move to the new week and pay in the year the reform is
-- applied in his school (5768 included); having so chosen, he may choose
-- to move at the start of each later school year.
@ref akn:art_10
GIVEN p IS AN `existing employee's post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may choose not to move` p IF
    p EQUALS `another existing teaching employee`

`choosing not to move` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `choose not to move to the reform this school year`

`choosing to move later` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `choose to move to the reform at the start of a later school year`

#ASSERT NOT `may choose not to move` `first deputy in post`

-- ¶2: the notice, for the next school year, in writing on the Ministry's
-- form, by (א) 1 May for teachers in primary and junior high schools; (ב)
-- in 5768, by 31.10.07. `school year` y is the year opening on 1 September
-- of y; the notice for it is due the May before.
@ref akn:art_10/p2 akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day for the notice of the choice for the school year from` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2007
    THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2007
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 y

#ASSERT `the last day for the notice of the choice for the school year from` 2007 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2007
#ASSERT `the last day for the notice of the choice for the school year from` 2009 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2009

§§ `11`

DECLARE `role allowance kind` IS ONE OF
    `an allowance §29 keeps`
    `an allowance the reform ends`

-- A teacher's status for the conversion (§34's table).
DECLARE `status` IS ONE OF
    `regular teacher`
    `mother teacher`
    `homeroom teacher`
    `homeroom teacher and mother`

-- §11: the conversion of one who chose under §10 and moves later: (1) his
-- status is the one he had when the reform was applied in his school; (2)
-- only the role allowances (save §29's) he was entitled to then count.
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11__para_1 akn:art_11__para_2
GIVEN `status when the reform came to the school` IS A `status`, `status when he moves` IS A `status`
GIVETH A `status`
DECIDE `the status a late mover converts by` `status when the reform came to the school` `status when he moves` IS
    `status when the reform came to the school`

GIVEN k IS A `role allowance kind`, `entitled when the reform came to the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counted in a late mover's conversion` k `entitled when the reform came to the school` IF
    k EQUALS `an allowance the reform ends` AND `entitled when the reform came to the school`

#ASSERT NOT `counted in a late mover's conversion` `an allowance §29 keeps` TRUE
#ASSERT `the status a late mover converts by` `regular teacher` `homeroom teacher` EQUALS `regular teacher`

§§ `12`

-- §12: one who chose not to move stays on the existing agreements for as
-- long as he so chooses.
@ref akn:art_12
GIVEN `still chooses not to move` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of employment`
DECIDE `the terms of one who chose not to move` `still chooses not to move` IS
    IF `still chooses not to move` THEN `the existing agreements` ELSE `the reform's terms`

§ `ו. מבנה שבוע העבודה החדש של מורים אקדמאיים`

-- akn:part_6 The heading of part F (the new work week of academic teachers inside the school); its articles follow.

@desc A teacher's weekly hours in the school, as part ו divides them.
DECLARE `work week` HAS
    `frontal hours`    IS A NUMBER @desc teaching in front of a class
    `individual hours` IS A NUMBER @desc with a group of pupils or one pupil
    `stay hours`       IS A NUMBER @desc שעות שהייה: in the school, on the work the article lists

GIVEN w IS A `work week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the week` w IS
    w's `frontal hours` PLUS w's `individual hours` PLUS w's `stay hours`

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a week of` f i s IS
    `work week` WITH
        `frontal hours`    IS f
        `individual hours` IS i
        `stay hours`       IS s

§§ `13`

-- §13: a full-position teacher works five days a week, also in a school
-- that works six.
@ref akn:art_13
`working days a week in a full position` MEANS 5

§§ `14 מורה בבית-ספר יסודי`

-- ¶1, (א)–(ד): a 100% position in a primary school is 36 hours: 26 frontal,
-- 5 individual and 5 stay hours.
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14/p1 akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_d
`a primary teacher's full week` MEANS `a week of` 26 5 5

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a primary teacher's full week` EQUALS 36

-- (ג): an individual hour is with a group "עד 5 תלמידים" or with one
-- pupil. A group is counted in whole pupils, and "עד 5" describes a group
-- of 5 (the exception is recorded under thresholds.until). The content of
-- the individual hours is the principal's, by the Ministry's general
-- guideline.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a group for individual hours` pupils IF
    pupils AT LEAST 1 AND pupils AT MOST 5

DECLARE `work-week action` IS ONE OF
    `set the content of the individual hours by the Ministry's general guideline`
    `impose further activities that require staying in the school`
    `reduce half an hour a day from the stay hours`

`setting the content of the individual hours` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `set the content of the individual hours by the Ministry's general guideline`

#ASSERT `a group for individual hours` 5 AND NOT `a group for individual hours` 6

DECLARE `stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `work meetings`
    `preparing learning materials and planning the teaching`
    `private meetings with parents`
    `checking work and exams`

-- (ד)(1)–(4): what the stay hours are spent on; work meetings — the
-- pedagogical council, the subject teams with their coordinators, the
-- multi-professional teams — "עד 2 שעות שבועיות" (a cap that takes 2 in).
@ref akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_4
`work meetings a week at most, in a primary school` MEANS 2

GIVEN `meeting hours` IS A NUMBER, `other stay hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the primary stay hours are lawfully divided` `meeting hours` `other stay hours` IF
        `meeting hours` AT MOST `work meetings a week at most, in a primary school`
    AND `meeting hours` PLUS `other stay hours` EQUALS `a primary teacher's full week`'s `stay hours`

#ASSERT `the primary stay hours are lawfully divided` 2 3

§§ `15 מורה המלמד בבית ספר יסודי לפי בסיס משרה של חטיבת ביניים`

-- §15: a primary teacher whose position base was kept at the junior-high
-- base (24 weekly hours), or a new teacher in grades 7–9 of a primary
-- school, who chose the reform, works the primary week of §§13–14.
@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15/p1
GIVEN `kept on the junior-high base, or new in grades 7–9 of a primary school` IS A BOOLEAN, `chose the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `works the primary week under section 15` `kept on the junior-high base, or new in grades 7–9 of a primary school` `chose the reform` IF
    `kept on the junior-high base, or new in grades 7–9 of a primary school` AND `chose the reform`

§§ `16 מורה בחטיבת ביניים`

-- ¶1, (א)–(ד): a 100% position in a junior high school is 36 hours: 23
-- frontal, 4 individual (a group "עד 5 תלמידים", as in §14) and 9 stay
-- hours; work meetings up to 4 hours a week.
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p1 akn:art_16__para_a akn:art_16__para_b akn:art_16__para_c akn:art_16__para_d akn:art_16__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_16__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_16__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_16__para_d__subpara_4
`a junior-high teacher's full week` MEANS `a week of` 23 4 9
`work meetings a week at most, in a junior high school` MEANS 4

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a junior-high teacher's full week` EQUALS 36

GIVEN s IS A `school kind`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the full week in` s IS
    IF s EQUALS `a junior high school`
    THEN `a junior-high teacher's full week`
    ELSE `a primary teacher's full week`

§§ `17 מורה אם`

-- §17: a mother teacher's full week is §14's or §16's; she may take half
-- an hour a day (2.5 weekly) off the stay hours of 14(ד) or 16(ד), with no
-- cut in her pay or her position.
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17/p1
`a mother's stay-hours reduction in a full position` MEANS 2.5

GIVEN s IS A `school kind`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a mother teacher's week` s IS
    `a week of` (full's `frontal hours`)
                (full's `individual hours`)
                (full's `stay hours` MINUS `a mother's stay-hours reduction in a full position`)
    WHERE
        full MEANS `the full week in` s

`a mother's reduction` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `reduce half an hour a day from the stay hours`

#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a mother teacher's week` `a primary school`) EQUALS 33.5

§§ `18 מורה במשרה חלקית`

-- akn:art_18 The article's heading: a part-time teacher.
-- akn:art_18/p1 The opening: the work week of a part-time teacher under the reform; (א)–(ד) follow.

-- (א): at 50% and above, each kind of hour in proportion to the position,
-- as §§14 and 16 set them, by the tables of annexes א' and ב' (not in this
-- document: the table's hours are an input where they differ). (ג): a
-- part-time mother teacher's week, the reduction included, is also the
-- annexes'.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_c
GIVEN `the annex's week for the position` IS A `work week` @desc the row of annex א' (primary) or ב' (junior high) for the teacher's position, and for a mother teacher her row
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a part-time teacher's week` `the annex's week for the position` IS
    `the annex's week for the position`

-- (ב): a teacher below 50% does not move to the reform unless the head of
-- the teaching personnel division approved the move and the week; a new
-- teacher is not employed below 50% unless the same head approved it.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `approved by the head of the teaching personnel division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position is allowed under section 18` `position fraction` `approved by the head of the teaching personnel division` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 50% OR `approved by the head of the teaching personnel division`

#ASSERT NOT `the position is allowed under section 18` 0.4 FALSE
#ASSERT `the position is allowed under section 18` 0.5 FALSE

-- (ד): a teacher in more than one primary or junior high school has his
-- hours computed for each school separately, by the tables.
@ref akn:art_18__para_d
GIVEN `the annex's week for each school` IS A LIST OF `work week`
GIVETH A LIST OF `work week`
DECIDE `the weeks of a teacher in several schools` `the annex's week for each school` IS
    `the annex's week for each school`

§§ `19 פעילויות נוספות`

-- ¶1: the principal may impose further activities that require staying in
-- the school, within the teacher's roles as the Director-General's
-- circular sets them, beyond the tasks of the monthly stay-hours quota.
-- ¶2: the hours of such activities come out of the stay hours; ¶3: the
-- stay hours are computed monthly. ¶4: the activities, how and how much of
-- the monthly stay hours they use, are left to the comprehensive agreement.
@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19/p1
`imposing further activities` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `impose further activities that require staying in the school`

@ref akn:art_19/p2 akn:art_19/p3
GIVEN `stay hours of the month` IS A NUMBER, `hours of further activities in the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `stay hours left in the month` `stay hours of the month` `hours of further activities in the month` IS
    `not below zero` (`stay hours of the month` MINUS `hours of further activities in the month`)

#ASSERT `stay hours left in the month` 21.65 5 EQUALS 16.65

-- akn:art_19/p4 Leaves the further activities to the comprehensive agreement; no rule.

§§ `20 שעות מילוי מקום`

-- (א): substitution follows the rules of the eve of the signing.
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20__para_a
`substitution follows the rules of the eve of the signing` MEANS TRUE

DECLARE `when a substitution hour is done` IS ONE OF
    `on a working day, not in place of a stay hour`
    `on the teacher's free day`
    `in place of a stay hour, which is not done`
    `in place of a stay hour, done on another day`

-- (ב)–(ה): 125% of the hour value (§22), also on the free day; in place of
-- a stay hour that day, 125% and not the stay hour's own 100%; in place of
-- a stay hour he does on another day, 125% and the stay hour's 100% too.
@ref akn:art_20__para_b akn:art_20__para_c akn:art_20__para_d akn:art_20__para_e
`the substitution rate` MEANS 125%
`the stay hour's own rate` MEANS 100%

GIVEN w IS A `when a substitution hour is done`, `hour value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for a substitution hour` w `hour value` IS
    IF w EQUALS `in place of a stay hour, done on another day`
    THEN (`the substitution rate` PLUS `the stay hour's own rate`) TIMES `hour value`
    ELSE `the substitution rate` TIMES `hour value`

#ASSERT `pay for a substitution hour` `on the teacher's free day` 50 EQUALS 62.5
#ASSERT `pay for a substitution hour` `in place of a stay hour, done on another day` 50 EQUALS 112.5

-- (ו): one employed only as a substitute in the school — not a teaching
-- employee of the State there otherwise — stays on the rules of the eve of
-- the signing.
@ref akn:art_20__para_f
GIVEN `employed in the school only as a substitute` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 20(ב)–(ה) apply` `employed in the school only as a substitute` IF
    NOT `employed in the school only as a substitute`

§§ `21 פעילויות בית ספריות`

DECLARE `school activity` IS ONE OF
    `a general school assembly`
    `an individual parents-and-children meeting`
    `an activity after school hours`

-- (ב): the activities and the hours of each in a half-year, "עד" a cap
-- that takes the number in: 4 + 8 + 6 is the 18 of (א).
@ref akn:art_21__para_b akn:art_21__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_21__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_21__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN a IS A `school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the activity a half-year at most` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `a general school assembly` THEN 4
    WHEN `an individual parents-and-children meeting` THEN 8
    WHEN `an activity after school hours` THEN 6

-- (א): 125% of the hour value (§22) for up to 18 hours in each half of the
-- school year; (ג)–(ה): the free day and the stay hour, as in §20.
@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21__para_a akn:art_21__para_c akn:art_21__para_d akn:art_21__para_e
`school-activity hours a half-year at most` MEANS 18
`the school-activity rate` MEANS 125%

GIVEN `hours of each activity` IS A FUNCTION FROM `school activity` TO NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `school-activity hours paid in the half-year` `hours of each activity` IS
    min `school-activity hours a half-year at most`
        (sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD min (`hours of each activity` a) (`hours of the activity a half-year at most` a))
                  (LIST `a general school assembly`, `an individual parents-and-children meeting`, `an activity after school hours`)))

GIVEN w IS A `when a substitution hour is done`, `hour value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for a school-activity hour` w `hour value` IS
    IF w EQUALS `in place of a stay hour, done on another day`
    THEN (`the school-activity rate` PLUS `the stay hour's own rate`) TIMES `hour value`
    ELSE `the school-activity rate` TIMES `hour value`

`the caps of (ב) together` MEANS
    sum (map `hours of the activity a half-year at most` (LIST `a general school assembly`, `an individual parents-and-children meeting`, `an activity after school hours`))
#ASSERT `the caps of (ב) together` EQUALS `school-activity hours a half-year at most`

GIVEN a IS A `school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `ten hours of each` a IS 10
#ASSERT `school-activity hours paid in the half-year` `ten hours of each` EQUALS 18

-- akn:art_21__para_f The comprehensive agreement is to examine allotting the hours differentially; no rule.

§§ `22 חישוב ערך שעה`

DECLARE `use of the hour value` IS ONE OF
    `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour`
    `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§20(ד))`
    `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§20(ה))`
    `a school-activities hour`
    `a deduction for an hour's absence`

@desc The monthly amounts the base of an hour's value is made of, for a 100% position.
DECLARE `pay for the hour value` HAS
    `combined salary`             IS A NUMBER @desc שכר משולב for a full position; from the tables of annexes ג'–ד', an input
    `pensionable role allowances` IS A NUMBER @desc the role allowances counted in the salary determining the pension, that the teacher earns in his regular salary

-- (א)(1): a substitution hour, save one in place of a stay hour "כאמור
-- בסעיף 20 (ד)": the combined salary. (2)–(4): a substitution hour in
-- place of a stay hour, a school-activities hour and a deduction for an
-- hour's absence: the combined salary and the pensionable role allowances.
--
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-c: (1) leaves out only the hour of §20(ד),
-- and (2) takes every substitution hour "במקום שעת שהיה"; the hour of
-- §20(ה), in place of a stay hour done on another day, is in both. The
-- reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): (2), which speaks of
-- exactly the hour in place of a stay hour.
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_22__para_a akn:art_22__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_22__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_22__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_22__para_a__subpara_4
GIVEN u IS A `use of the hour value`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the clauses of 22(א) whose words take` u IS
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour` THEN LIST "(1)"
    WHEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§20(ד))` THEN LIST "(2)"
    WHEN `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§20(ה))` THEN LIST "(1)", "(2)"
    WHEN `a school-activities hour` THEN LIST "(3)"
    WHEN `a deduction for an hour's absence` THEN LIST "(4)"

GIVEN u IS A `use of the hour value`, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the hour value` u p IS
    IF u EQUALS `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour`
    THEN p's `combined salary`
    ELSE p's `combined salary` PLUS p's `pensionable role allowances`

`the hour of §20(ה) falls under two clauses of 22(א)` MEANS
    count (`the clauses of 22(א) whose words take` `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, done on another day (§20(ה))`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the hour of §20(ה) falls under two clauses of 22(א)`

-- (ב): the hour's value is the base for a 100% position over 4.33 weeks
-- times 36 hours. No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_22__para_b akn:art_22__para_b/p2 akn:art_22__para_b/p3
`weeks in a month` MEANS 4.33
`hours in a full week` MEANS 36

GIVEN base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value` base IS
    base DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month` TIMES `hours in a full week`)

`a teacher for the hour value` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 7794
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 779.4
#ASSERT `the hour value` (`the base of the hour value` `a school-activities hour` `a teacher for the hour value`) EQUALS 55
#ASSERT `the hour value` (`the base of the hour value` `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour` `a teacher for the hour value`) EQUALS 50

§§ `23 הסדר כולל`

-- (א): no more than 10.5 hours in a working day, of regular hours (§§14,
-- 16), substitution and school activities together.
@ref akn:art_23 akn:art_23__para_a
`hours in a working day at most` MEANS 10.5

GIVEN `regular hours` IS A NUMBER, `substitution hours` IS A NUMBER, `school-activity hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the day is within section 23(א)` `regular hours` `substitution hours` `school-activity hours` IF
    `regular hours` PLUS `substitution hours` PLUS `school-activity hours` AT MOST `hours in a working day at most`

#ASSERT `the day is within section 23(א)` 8 2 0.5
#ASSERT NOT `the day is within section 23(א)` 8 2 1

DECLARE `kind of work` IS ONE OF
    `regular hours`
    `substitution`
    `school activities`
    `escorting trips`
    `other work`

-- (ב): the pay for the regular hours, substitution and school activities
-- is a global arrangement for all of the teacher's work, save the
-- trip-escort allowance (§30).
@ref akn:art_23__para_b
GIVEN k IS A `kind of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid beside the global arrangement` k IF
    k EQUALS `escorting trips`

#ASSERT NOT `paid beside the global arrangement` `other work`

§§ `24 היקף העסקה`

-- (א): in a reform school a teacher is employed up to 100% only; in no
-- more than two schools (with or without the reform in either), the two
-- together at most 100%, all subject to the Ministry's approval.
@ref akn:art_24 akn:art_24__para_a
`the position under the reform at most` MEANS 100%

GIVEN positions IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `approved by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the employment is allowed under section 24` positions `approved by the Ministry` IF
        count positions AT MOST 2
    AND sum positions AT MOST `the position under the reform at most`
    AND `approved by the Ministry`

#ASSERT `the employment is allowed under section 24` (LIST 0.6, 0.4) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the employment is allowed under section 24` (LIST 0.6, 0.5) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the employment is allowed under section 24` (LIST 0.3, 0.3, 0.3) TRUE

-- (ב): the Ministry announces its aim to try to complete to a full
-- position the positions of reform teachers at 80% and above, at the
-- teacher's request, within the budget, the school's needs and its
-- discretion; ¶2: and to prefer that completion to taking on new teachers.
-- An announced aim, not a right: what it reaches is encoded, the outcome is
-- the Ministry's discretion.
@ref akn:art_24__para_b akn:art_24__para_b/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the Ministry's aim to complete the position` `position fraction` IF
    `position fraction` AT LEAST 80% AND `position fraction` LESS THAN 100%

#ASSERT `within the Ministry's aim to complete the position` 0.8

§ `ז. מבנה השכר החדש למורים אקדמאיים`

-- akn:part_7 The heading of part G (the new salary structure for academic teachers); its articles follow.

§§ `25 טבלת השכר המשולב החדשה`

DECLARE `academic table` IS ONE OF
    `the first-degree table`
    `the second-degree table`

-- (א): the new combined-salary tables, for first- and second-degree
-- teachers, are annexes ג' and ד' (not in this document): a cell is an
-- input. (ב): teachers advance in them by grade and seniority.
@ref akn:art_25 akn:art_25__para_a akn:art_25__para_b
GIVEN t IS AN `academic table`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the annex of` t IS
    IF t EQUALS `the first-degree table` THEN "ג'" ELSE "ד'"

-- (ג): the tables of annexes ג'–ד' are updated on 1.12.08 by 1.5% and on
-- 1.1.10 to 3% in all, relative to the annexes' tables. ¶2: the update
-- turns on the wage agreement being signed, and its dates follow it.
@ref akn:art_25__para_c akn:art_25__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_25__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_25__para_c__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the update of the new tables` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010) THEN 3%
    ELSE (IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008) THEN 1.5% ELSE 0)

GIVEN `the annex's cell` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new table's cell on` `the annex's cell` d IS
    `the annex's cell` TIMES (1 PLUS `the update of the new tables` d)

#ASSERT `the update of the new tables` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 2008) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a new table's cell on` 8000 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010) EQUALS 8240

§§ `26 שיבוץ בטבלאות השכר`

DECLARE `highest degree` IS ONE OF
    `a first degree`
    `a second degree`
    `a doctorate`

-- (א): a new academic teacher, after the internship year, is placed at
-- grade 0, seniority 0. (ב)–(ד): a first degree in the first-degree table;
-- a second degree or a doctorate with a teaching certificate in the
-- second-degree table (without the certificate, by (ב), in the
-- first-degree one); a doctorate adds 5% of the combined salary in the
-- table. ¶2: "degree" is an academic degree as §6 defines one.
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26__para_a
`a new academic teacher's grade` MEANS 0
`a new academic teacher's seniority` MEANS 0

@ref akn:art_26__para_b akn:art_26__para_c akn:art_26__para_d akn:art_26__para_d/p2
GIVEN d IS A `highest degree`, `holds a teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `academic table`
DECIDE `the table for` d `holds a teaching certificate` IS
    IF d EQUALS `a first degree` OR NOT `holds a teaching certificate`
    THEN `the first-degree table`
    ELSE `the second-degree table`

`the doctorate rate` MEANS 5%

GIVEN d IS A `highest degree`, `holds a teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN, `combined salary in the table` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the doctorate supplement` d `holds a teaching certificate` `combined salary in the table` IS
    IF d EQUALS `a doctorate` AND `holds a teaching certificate`
    THEN `the doctorate rate` TIMES `combined salary in the table`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the table for` `a doctorate` TRUE EQUALS `the second-degree table`
#ASSERT `the doctorate supplement` `a doctorate` TRUE 9000 EQUALS 450

§§ `27 ותק בהוראה`

-- §27: seniority for advancing in the new table is teaching seniority as
-- the takanon defines it today and as it will be — after the internship,
-- without compulsory army service, but with army or national service in
-- teaching by the rules the takanon will set. The takanon's §1.29 counts
-- that seniority; it cannot be imported by its name (see the head of this
-- file), so the years it counts are an input.
@ref akn:art_27 akn:art_27/p1
GIVEN `years of teaching seniority by the takanon, after the internship` IS A NUMBER @desc counted by takanon §1.29.3, the internship year left out
      `years of compulsory army service among them` IS A NUMBER
      `years of army or national service in teaching, by the takanon's rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recognised seniority` `years of teaching seniority by the takanon, after the internship` `years of compulsory army service among them` `years of army or national service in teaching, by the takanon's rules` IS
        `not below zero` (`years of teaching seniority by the takanon, after the internship` MINUS `years of compulsory army service among them`)
    PLUS `years of army or national service in teaching, by the takanon's rules`

#ASSERT `recognised seniority` 10 0 1 EQUALS 11

§§ `28(ב), (ו) Years in a grade`

-- (ב) and (ו): the years in the grade below that promotion to each grade
-- asks — two to grades 1 and 2, three to grades 3 to 8.
@ref akn:art_28__para_b akn:art_28__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_28__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_28__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_28__para_f akn:art_28__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_f__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_f__subpara_3
GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years in the grade below for promotion to` `to grade` IS
    IF `to grade` AT MOST 2 THEN 2 ELSE 3

§§ `28(ג)–(ד) What counts in the years`

DECLARE `kind of period` IS ONE OF
    `work in the grade`
    `statutory maternity leave`
    `reserve duty`
    `continuous service as principal, deputy or counsellor that gave no promotion in those roles`
    `a sabbatical`
    `unpaid leave`

@desc A period in a grade, as far as §28(ג)–(ד) ask.
DECLARE `period in a grade` HAS
    kind     IS A `kind of period`
    years    IS A NUMBER
    `on the sabbatical, employed at least a third of a position by the takanon's rules` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 28(ג)(4)(א)
    `on the sabbatical, studied the didactic fields the training division recognised` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 28(ג)(4)(ב), by circular סז/3(ב) §§6.1.1–6.4.1

-- (ג)(1)–(3): maternity leave by law, reserve duty, and continuous work as
-- principal, first, second or third deputy or counsellor that gave no
-- promotion in those roles count. (ד)(1): unpaid leave of every kind does
-- not.
@ref akn:art_28__para_c akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_3 akn:art_28__para_d akn:art_28__para_d__subpara_1
GIVEN k IS A `kind of period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts in full` k IF
    NOT (k EQUALS `unpaid leave` OR k EQUALS `a sabbatical`)

-- (ג)(4): a sabbatical counts only if (א) the teacher went on working a
-- third of a position or more in the civil service, by the takanon's
-- rules, or (ב) the training division found he studied the didactic fields
-- of circular סז/3(ב) §§6.1.1–6.4.1; "במקרה זה" the year counts as half a
-- year. (ד)(2): a sabbatical meeting neither does not count.
--
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-e: the half-year sentence is printed in (ב)
-- (convention reading.placement: it applies to the clause it is printed
-- in), so a sabbatical under (א) counts in full and one under (ב) as half;
-- one that meets both is a full year by one and half by the other, and the
-- reading adopted (convention amounts.highest) takes the full year.
@ref akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_4 akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_4__cls_a akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_4__cls_b akn:art_28__para_d__subpara_2
GIVEN p IS A `period in a grade`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `what each clause counts of a sabbatical year` p IS
    append (IF p's `on the sabbatical, employed at least a third of a position by the takanon's rules` THEN LIST 1 ELSE EMPTY)
           (IF p's `on the sabbatical, studied the didactic fields the training division recognised` THEN LIST 0.5 ELSE EMPTY)

GIVEN p IS A `period in a grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years the period counts for` p IS
    IF p's kind EQUALS `a sabbatical`
    THEN p's years TIMES foldr max 0 (`what each clause counts of a sabbatical year` p)
    ELSE IF `counts in full` (p's kind) THEN p's years ELSE 0

GIVEN periods IS A LIST OF `period in a grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years counted in the grade` periods IS
    sum (map `years the period counts for` periods)

GIVEN k IS A `kind of period`, years IS A NUMBER, a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `period in a grade`
DECIDE `a period of` k years a b IS
    `period in a grade` WITH
        kind  IS k
        years IS years
        `on the sabbatical, employed at least a third of a position by the takanon's rules` IS a
        `on the sabbatical, studied the didactic fields the training division recognised` IS b

#ASSERT `years counted in the grade` (LIST `a period of` `work in the grade` 1 FALSE FALSE, `a period of` `a sabbatical` 1 FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `years counted in the grade` (LIST `a period of` `work in the grade` 1 FALSE FALSE, `a period of` `unpaid leave` 1 FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 1

`a sabbatical meeting both clauses` MEANS `a period of` `a sabbatical` 1 TRUE TRUE
`the clauses count a sabbatical meeting both differently` MEANS
    `what each clause counts of a sabbatical year` `a sabbatical meeting both clauses` EQUALS LIST 1, 0.5
#ASSERT `the clauses count a sabbatical meeting both differently`
#ASSERT `years the period counts for` `a sabbatical meeting both clauses` EQUALS 1

§§ `28(א), (ה) Promotion to grades 1–8`

@desc A teacher in a grade, as far as §28 asks.
DECLARE `candidate` HAS
    grade                           IS A NUMBER
    `periods in the grade`          IS A LIST OF `period in a grade`
    `meets the Ministry's criteria` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the criteria in the Ministry's letter to the union before the comprehensive agreement, which the corpus does not hold
    `evaluation recommends promotion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 28(ה)(3): the evaluations under the Ministry's professional directions, with RAMA
    `evaluation score`              IS A NUMBER

-- (א): to grades 1–5, the years of (ב) and the Ministry's criteria; (ה):
-- to grades 6–8, the years of (ו), the criteria and an evaluation that
-- recommends promotion.
@ref akn:art_28 akn:art_28__para_a akn:art_28__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_e akn:art_28__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_e__subpara_3
GIVEN c IS A `candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the conditions for the next grade` c IF
        c's grade AT LEAST 0
    AND c's grade AT MOST 7
    AND `years counted in the grade` (c's `periods in the grade`) AT LEAST `years in the grade below for promotion to` (c's grade PLUS 1)
    AND c's `meets the Ministry's criteria`
    AND (c's grade PLUS 1 AT MOST 5 OR c's `evaluation recommends promotion`)

§§ `28(ז)–(יא) The quotas of grades 6–8`

-- (ז): the positions in grades 6, 7 and 8 never pass 10%, 5% and 3% of
-- all the positions — those of official primary and junior high schools
-- where the reform is not yet applied included, special education in
-- special-education schools, kindergarten teachers, supervisors and the
-- instruction share of instructors left out (¶2) — and "all the positions"
-- are never fewer than on the eve of the signing (¶3).
@ref akn:art_28__para_g akn:art_28__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_g__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_g__subpara_3 akn:art_28__para_g/p2 akn:art_28__para_g/p3
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the quota of the grade` grade IS
    BRANCH IF grade EQUALS 6 THEN 10%
           IF grade EQUALS 7 THEN 5%
           IF grade EQUALS 8 THEN 3%
           OTHERWISE 1

GIVEN `all positions now` IS A NUMBER, `all positions on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `all the positions for the quotas` `all positions now` `all positions on the eve of the signing` IS
    max `all positions now` `all positions on the eve of the signing`

GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER, `positions in the grade` IS A NUMBER, `all the positions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `free positions in the quota` grade `positions in the grade` `all the positions` IS
    `not below zero` ((`the quota of the grade` grade TIMES `all the positions`) MINUS `positions in the grade`)

#ASSERT `free positions in the quota` 6 900 10000 EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `all the positions for the quotas` 9500 10000 EQUALS 10000

-- (ח): a yearly check, by a procedure the parties agree, of whether the
-- quotas allow promotion next year; if so, among those who met "בתנאים (1)
-- ו – (2) בסעיף קטן (ג)", the highest scores in the evaluation "לפי תנאי
-- (3) בסעיף קטן (ג)" first. F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-d: (ג) lists the
-- periods that count, not conditions; the conditions (1)–(3) — the years,
-- the criteria, the evaluation — are (ה)'s. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.misprint): (ה)'s.
@ref akn:art_28__para_h
GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF `candidate`
GIVETH A LIST OF `candidate`
DECIDE `the order of promotion` cs IS
    sortBy (GIVEN a, b YIELD a's `evaluation score` AT LEAST b's `evaluation score`)
           (filter (GIVEN c YIELD c's `meets the Ministry's criteria`) cs)

`what 28(ג)(3) lists` MEANS "continuous service as principal, deputy or counsellor"
`what 28(ה)(3) lists` MEANS "the results of the evaluations"
`28(ח) takes its evaluation condition from (ג), which lists none` MEANS
    NOT (`what 28(ג)(3) lists` EQUALS `what 28(ה)(3) lists`)
#ASSERT `28(ח) takes its evaluation condition from (ג), which lists none`

-- (ט): one who met the conditions of (ה) is not held back from grade 6, 7
-- or 8 more than 3, 4 or 5 years, subject to a free place in the quota:
-- once held back that long, the next free place is his, before the scores
-- of (ח).
@ref akn:art_28__para_i akn:art_28__para_i__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_i__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_i__subpara_3
GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years a qualified teacher may be held back from` `to grade` IS
    BRANCH IF `to grade` EQUALS 6 THEN 3
           IF `to grade` EQUALS 7 THEN 4
           OTHERWISE 5

GIVEN `to grade` IS A NUMBER, `years held back` IS A NUMBER, `free places` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `goes before the scores` `to grade` `years held back` `free places` IF
        `years held back` AT LEAST `years a qualified teacher may be held back from` `to grade`
    AND `free places` GREATER THAN 0

#ASSERT `goes before the scores` 7 4 1
#ASSERT NOT `goes before the scores` 8 4 1

-- (י): the existing teachers placed in grades 6–8 by the conversion, or
-- promoted to them at the first promotion after it (§37), count in the
-- quotas; (יא): the quotas never stop that placement or that promotion.
@ref akn:art_28__para_j akn:art_28__para_ja
GIVEN `by the conversion or the first promotion after it` IS A BOOLEAN, `free places` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the quota allows the placement` `by the conversion or the first promotion after it` `free places` IF
    `by the conversion or the first promotion after it` OR `free places` GREATER THAN 0

#ASSERT `the quota allows the placement` TRUE 0

§§ `29 גמולי תפקיד אשר ימשיכו להתקיים ברפורמה`

@desc A role whose allowance goes on under the reform.
DECLARE `role` IS ONE OF
    `class educator`
    `special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school`
    `subject coordinator`
    `road-safety coordinator`
    `security coordinator`
    `social-education coordinator`
    `grade coordinator`
    `laboratory coordinator`
    `evaluation and measurement coordinator`

-- (א)(1)–(9): from the move, an allowance for these roles only, each at its
-- rate of the combined salary.
@ref akn:art_29 akn:art_29__para_a akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_6 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_7 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_8 akn:art_29__para_a__subpara_9
GIVEN r IS A `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role rate` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `class educator` THEN 10%
    WHEN `special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school` THEN 14%
    WHEN `subject coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `road-safety coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `security coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `social-education coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `grade coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `laboratory coordinator` THEN 3%
    WHEN `evaluation and measurement coordinator` THEN 6%

`the homeroom allowance rate` MEANS `the role rate` `class educator`

-- (ב): the evaluation coordinator's allowance only if appointed by the
-- Ministry's rules and in place of another role (א) lists.
@ref akn:art_29__para_b
GIVEN r IS A `role`, `appointed by the Ministry's rules in place of another listed role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the role's allowance may be paid` r `appointed by the Ministry's rules in place of another listed role` IF
    (NOT r EQUALS `evaluation and measurement coordinator`)
    OR `appointed by the Ministry's rules in place of another listed role`

#ASSERT `the role's allowance may be paid` `evaluation and measurement coordinator` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the role's allowance may be paid` `evaluation and measurement coordinator` FALSE
#ASSERT `the role's allowance may be paid` `class educator` FALSE

-- (ג): at most two allowances, unless the district manager approved one
-- for a further role. F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-f: the clause caps their
-- number and does not say which two a teacher holding more is paid. The
-- reading adopted (convention amounts.highest): the two highest.
@ref akn:art_29__para_c
GIVEN `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager` IS
    IF `approved by the district manager` THEN 3 ELSE 2

GIVEN `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN, roles IS A LIST OF `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowances paid` `combined salary` `approved by the district manager` roles IS
    sum (take (`role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager`)
              (sortBy (GIVEN a, b YIELD a AT LEAST b)
                      (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the role rate` r TIMES `combined salary`) roles)))

#ASSERT `the role allowances paid` 8000 FALSE (LIST `laboratory coordinator`, `class educator`, `security coordinator`) EQUALS 1280

`three roles held, two paid` MEANS
        count (LIST `class educator`, `security coordinator`, `laboratory coordinator`)
            GREATER THAN `role allowances payable at most` FALSE
    AND NOT (`the role rate` `security coordinator` EQUALS `the role rate` `laboratory coordinator`)
#ASSERT `three roles held, two paid`

-- (ד): the rules and conditions of these allowances before the move go on,
-- save those on reducing hours: no allowance is paid by adding or taking
-- weekly hours of any kind off the position.
@ref akn:art_29__para_d
DECLARE `form of an allowance` IS ONE OF `a percentage of the combined salary`, `hours added to or taken off the position`

GIVEN f IS A `form of an allowance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allowance may be paid as` f IF
    f EQUALS `a percentage of the combined salary`

§§ `30 גמול ליווי טיולים`

-- §30: the trip-escort allowance is paid by the collective agreement of
-- 8.9.98 — the one with הסתדרות המורים, imported
-- (1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul):
-- units by the hour an activity ends, each 0.7% of the monthly combined
-- salary — but only for hours beyond the new work hours of part ו.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-t: that agreement pays by the hour an
-- activity ends, not by its hours. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.as-printed), as for the same words in §40 of the base agreement
-- (F-ofek-hadash-base-40-a): a condition, not a new amount — an activity
-- running past the work hours earns the units of the hour it ends, one
-- ending within them none.
@ref akn:art_30 akn:art_30/p1
GIVEN `escort hours` IS A NUMBER, `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `escort hours beyond the work hours of part ו` `escort hours` `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS
    `not below zero` (`escort hours` MINUS `of them within the work hours of part ו`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity` @desc the activity, by the kinds of §4.ב of the agreement of 8.9.98
      `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
      `escort hours` IS A NUMBER
      `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the trip-escort allowance` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher` `escort hours` `of them within the work hours of part ו` IS
    IF `escort hours beyond the work hours of part ו` `escort hours` `of them within the work hours of part ו` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN `the 1998 Histadrut reward for an activity` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher`
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `escort hours beyond the work hours of part ו` 10 4 EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `the trip-escort allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2007) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 10 4 EQUALS 245
#ASSERT `the trip-escort allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2007) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 15) 10000 FALSE 4 4 EQUALS 0

-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-t's evidence: two escorts ending at 20:00,
-- with 6 hours beyond the work hours and with 3, are paid the same.
`§30 counts hours and the agreement of 8.9.98 pays by the hour an activity ends` MEANS
        `escort hours beyond the work hours of part ו` 10 4 GREATER THAN `escort hours beyond the work hours of part ו` 7 4
    AND `the trip-escort allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2007) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 10 4
            EQUALS `the trip-escort allowance` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2007) (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 20) 10000 FALSE 7 4
#ASSERT `§30 counts hours and the agreement of 8.9.98 pays by the hour an activity ends`

§§ `31 גמולי תפקיד שהיו קיימים ערב הרפורמה ואשר יחדלו להתקיים`

-- §31: ending the role allowances of the eve of the reform takes no role
-- or task off the teacher that was, or used to be, put on him.
@ref akn:art_31 akn:art_31/p1
`ending an allowance takes away its role or tasks` MEANS FALSE

§§ `32 יוח"א`

-- akn:art_32 The parties will discuss, toward the comprehensive agreement, a grant for the extended school day (Yocha); no rule.

§ `ח. המרת שכר למורים קיימים שהנם אקדמאים`

-- akn:part_8 The heading of part H (the salary conversion of existing academic teachers); its articles follow.

§§ `33 ההמרה`

-- §33: the salary of existing academic teachers who move to the new
-- structure (parts ו–ז), in the year the reform comes to their school or
-- a year they choose, is converted as below.
@ref akn:art_33 akn:art_33/p1
GIVEN `existing` IS A BOOLEAN, `academic` IS A BOOLEAN, `moves to the new structure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `converted under part ח` `existing` `academic` `moves to the new structure` IF
    `existing` AND `academic` AND `moves to the new structure`

-- §33 sends the year one chooses to move to part ו ("בהתאם לאמור בפרק ו'
-- לעיל"); the choice is §10's, in part ה. F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-g
-- (convention reading.misprint): the reading is §10.
`the part §10 is in` MEANS "ה"
`the part §33 names for the choice` MEANS "ו"
`33 sends the choice to a part that holds none` MEANS
    NOT (`the part §33 names for the choice` EQUALS `the part §10 is in`)
#ASSERT `33 sends the choice to a part that holds none`

§§ `34(X) X, the salary to convert`

DECLARE `the teacher's state in the determining month` IS ONE OF
    `at work`
    `on unpaid leave or a sabbatical on the eve of the move`
    `on maternity leave or reserve duty in March`

DECLARE `month of the salary to convert` IS ONE OF
    `March of the school year before the move`
    `March of the school year before the unpaid leave, updated by the raises he would have had`

-- akn:art_34 The article's heading line; X, Y and A follow.
-- ¶1–¶4: X is what the teacher would have earned for a 100% position by
-- his roles, in the March salary of the school year before the move ("החודש
-- הקובע"), subject to §11, in the components below only. One on unpaid
-- leave or a sabbatical on the eve of the move takes the March of the
-- school year before the leave, updated by the raises he would have had;
-- one on maternity leave or reserve duty in March, what he would have
-- earned for a 100% position but for it.
@ref akn:art_34/p1 akn:art_34/p2 akn:art_34/p3 akn:art_34/p4
GIVEN s IS A `the teacher's state in the determining month`
GIVETH A `month of the salary to convert`
DECIDE `the month X is taken from` s IS
    IF s EQUALS `on unpaid leave or a sabbatical on the eve of the move`
    THEN `March of the school year before the unpaid leave, updated by the raises he would have had`
    ELSE `March of the school year before the move`

DECLARE `pay component` IS ONE OF
    `the combined salary`
    `the 1987 supplement`
    `the 1994 supplement`
    `the 2001 supplement`
    `a role allowance that does not go on under this agreement`
    `the training allowance`
    `the double-degree allowance`
    `the minimum-wage supplement`
    `the instruction allowance`
    `a role allowance §29 keeps`
    `another component`

-- ¶5–¶13: the components; ¶14: the instruction allowance is left to the
-- comprehensive agreement and not counted.
@ref akn:art_34/p5 akn:art_34/p6 akn:art_34/p7 akn:art_34/p8 akn:art_34/p9 akn:art_34/p10 akn:art_34/p11 akn:art_34/p12 akn:art_34/p13 akn:art_34/p14
GIVEN c IS A `pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the salary to convert` c IF
    NOT (   c EQUALS `the instruction allowance`
         OR c EQUALS `a role allowance §29 keeps`
         OR c EQUALS `another component`)

GIVEN `amount of each component` IS A FUNCTION FROM `pay component` TO NUMBER, components IS A LIST OF `pay component`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `X, the salary to convert` `amount of each component` components IS
    sum (map `amount of each component` (filter `in the salary to convert` components))

GIVEN c IS A `pay component`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a thousand of each` c IS 1000
#ASSERT `X, the salary to convert` `a thousand of each` (LIST `the combined salary`, `the 2001 supplement`, `the instruction allowance`) EQUALS 2000

-- ¶15: for one who chose not to move in the year the reform came to his
-- school (§10), only the role allowances, save §29's, he had then — §11(2)
-- again; `counted in a late mover's conversion` is that rule.
@ref akn:art_34/p15
`¶15 of §34 is §11(2)` MEANS NOT `counted in a late mover's conversion` `an allowance §29 keeps` TRUE
#ASSERT `¶15 of §34 is §11(2)`

§§ `34(Y) Y, the conversion coefficient`

DECLARE `position base` IS ONE OF
    `the primary base of 30 weekly hours`
    `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`

-- ¶16–¶18 and the table: the addition, in percent, for one on a single
-- position base, by status and the school he will work in: a regular
-- teacher 17 / 27, a mother 24 / 34, a homeroom teacher 20 / 30, a
-- homeroom teacher and mother 27 / 37 (primary / junior high). ¶19: for
-- one who chose not to move at first, the status of the year the reform
-- came to his school (§11(1), `the status a late mover converts by`).
@ref akn:art_34/p16 akn:art_34/p17 akn:art_34/p18 akn:art_34/t1 akn:art_34/p19
GIVEN s IS A `status`, b IS A `position base`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y on a single base` s b IS
    IF b EQUALS `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`
    THEN (CONSIDER s
          WHEN `regular teacher`            THEN 27
          WHEN `mother teacher`             THEN 34
          WHEN `homeroom teacher`           THEN 30
          WHEN `homeroom teacher and mother` THEN 37)
    ELSE (CONSIDER s
          WHEN `regular teacher`            THEN 17
          WHEN `mother teacher`             THEN 24
          WHEN `homeroom teacher`           THEN 20
          WHEN `homeroom teacher and mother` THEN 27)

#ASSERT `Y on a single base` `homeroom teacher and mother` `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours` EQUALS 37
#ASSERT `Y on a single base` `mother teacher` `the primary base of 30 weekly hours` EQUALS 24

-- ¶20–¶24: on two bases, Y = H × (the junior-high addition) + S × (the
-- primary addition), H and S the shares of the whole position on each,
-- even above 100%. ¶25: the status, again, as in ¶19.
@ref akn:art_34/p20 akn:art_34/p21 akn:art_34/p22 akn:art_34/p23 akn:art_34/p24 akn:art_34/p25
GIVEN s IS A `status`, `position on the 24-hour base` IS A NUMBER, `position on the 30-hour base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y on two bases` s `position on the 24-hour base` `position on the 30-hour base` IS
    (    `position on the 24-hour base` TIMES `Y on a single base` s `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`
     PLUS `position on the 30-hour base` TIMES `Y on a single base` s `the primary base of 30 weekly hours`)
    DIVIDED BY (`position on the 24-hour base` PLUS `position on the 30-hour base`)

-- The example (¶26–¶31): a regular teacher of 110%, 70% on the 30-hour
-- base and 40% on the 24-hour one: (40/110 × 27) + (70/110 × 17) = 20.64.
@ref akn:art_34/p26 akn:art_34/p27 akn:art_34/p28 akn:art_34/p29 akn:art_34/p30 akn:art_34/p31
#ASSERT `to the agora` (`Y on two bases` `regular teacher` 0.4 0.7) EQUALS 20.64
#ASSERT `Y on two bases` `homeroom teacher` 0 1 EQUALS 20

§§ `34(A) A`

-- ¶32–¶33: A = X × (100 + Y)%, on one base or two. No rounding is stated
-- (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_34/p32 akn:art_34/p33
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A, the converted pay` x y IS
    x TIMES (100 PLUS y) DIVIDED BY 100

#ASSERT `A, the converted pay` 7000 17 EQUALS 8190

§§ `35 שיבוץ מורה אקדמאי בטבלת השכר המשולב`

@desc One cell of a salary table's row: a grade (whole, or intermediate as 3.5) and its salary for a full position.
DECLARE `table cell` HAS
    grade  IS A NUMBER
    salary IS A NUMBER

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `a cell` g s IS
    `table cell` WITH
        grade  IS g
        salary IS s

GIVEN cells IS A LIST OF `table cell`
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the top cell of the row` cells IS
    CONSIDER cells
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `a cell` 0 0
    WHEN c FOLLOWED BY rest THEN foldr (GIVEN x, best YIELD IF x's grade GREATER THAN best's grade THEN x ELSE best) c rest

-- The placement every conversion in this agreement uses: in the row, the
-- grade or intermediate grade whose salary is the closest to A, equal to
-- it or above it; above the top of the row, the top grade.
GIVEN cells IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the cell closest to A from above` cells a IS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN c YIELD c's salary AT LEAST a) cells
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `the top cell of the row` cells
    WHEN c FOLLOWED BY rest THEN foldr (GIVEN x, best YIELD IF x's salary LESS THAN best's salary THEN x ELSE best) c rest

-- (א): for the conversion only, the tables carry intermediate grades too:
-- annexes ה' and ו' (not in this document; a row of cells is an input).
-- (ב): a first-degree teacher is placed in the new table, in the row of
-- his seniority at the conversion, at the grade or intermediate grade
-- closest to A from above. (ג): never below the starting grade of his
-- row, which the placement from above already gives. (ד): A above grade 8
-- of his row places him at grade 8.
@ref akn:art_35 akn:art_35__para_a akn:art_35__para_b akn:art_35__para_c akn:art_35__para_d
GIVEN `the row of his seniority, intermediate grades included` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the first-degree placement` `the row of his seniority, intermediate grades included` a IS
    `the cell closest to A from above` `the row of his seniority, intermediate grades included` a

-- (ג) ¶2: so in 5768 the lowest table salary of an academic teacher who
-- moves is not below 5,300 for a full position at seniority 0.
`the 5768 table floor at seniority 0` MEANS 5300

GIVEN `the row at seniority 0` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5768 row meets 35(ג)'s floor` `the row at seniority 0` IF
    all (GIVEN c YIELD c's salary AT LEAST `the 5768 table floor at seniority 0`) `the row at seniority 0`

-- An illustrative row (the annexes are not in this document): the cells of
-- grades 3, 3.5 and 4 are §36's and §47's figures, the rest placeholders.
`an illustrative row` MEANS LIST `a cell` 3 8200, `a cell` 3.5 8414, `a cell` 4 8600, `a cell` 8 9900
#ASSERT `the first-degree placement` `an illustrative row` 8190 EQUALS `a cell` 3 8200
#ASSERT `the first-degree placement` `an illustrative row` 8300 EQUALS `a cell` 3.5 8414
#ASSERT `the first-degree placement` `an illustrative row` 12000 EQUALS `a cell` 8 9900

-- (ה)–(ו): a second-degree, or a doctorate, teacher with a teaching
-- certificate: the grade the first-degree table would give, in the
-- second-degree table; a doctorate adds 5% of the combined salary
-- (§26(ד)). (ז): the pay is by the position under the reform, never above
-- 100%.
@ref akn:art_35__para_e akn:art_35__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_35__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_35__para_f akn:art_35__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_35__para_f__subpara_2 akn:art_35__para_f__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN `the first-degree row` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade a second-degree teacher is placed at` `the first-degree row` a IS
    (`the first-degree placement` `the first-degree row` a)'s grade

@ref akn:art_35__para_g
GIVEN `table salary` IS A NUMBER, `position under the reform` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the converted teacher's pay` `table salary` `position under the reform` IS
    `table salary` TIMES min `position under the reform` 1

#ASSERT `the converted teacher's pay` 8414 1.1 EQUALS 8414

§§ `36 חישוב ושיבוץ עתידיים`

-- (א): the computation and placement of §§34–35 are made on the eve of the
-- move by X as it then is, and again, in separate computations, by X as it
-- will be at each date of §76(ב) after the move — (ב) as §76(ג) corrects
-- it. (ב): where one changes
-- the placement, it is corrected from that date, and the years in the new
-- grade count from it. (ג): the teacher gets, at the conversion, a form
-- detailing X, the determining salary, the seniority, and his grade now
-- and in the future.
@ref akn:art_36 akn:art_36__para_a akn:art_36__para_b akn:art_36__para_c
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, `salary month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `X as it will be in the salary month` x `salary month` IS
    x TIMES (1 PLUS `the old salary's update as corrected` `salary month`)

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `salary month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A at a date of §76(ב)` x y `salary month` IS
    `A, the converted pay` (`X as it will be in the salary month` x `salary month`) y

-- The example (¶2 to (4)): a regular primary teacher, BA, 100%, seniority
-- 15, X = 7,000, moving in September 2007. (1) A = 117% × 7,000 = 8,190,
-- placed at 8,414 (grade 3.5); (2) on the 1.5% of January 2008, A =
-- 8,312.85, the grade unchanged; (4) on the completion to 5% in January
-- 2010, A = 8,599.5; the new table's cell is 3% above the annex's.
@ref akn:art_36__para_c/p2 akn:art_36__para_c/p3 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_1__cls_a/p2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_2__cls_a/p2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_2__cls_b akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_2__cls_b/p2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_4 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_4__cls_a akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_4__cls_a/p2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_4__cls_b akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_4__cls_b/p2
#ASSERT `A at a date of §76(ב)` 7000 17 (`the salary month` 2007 9) EQUALS 8190
#ASSERT `A at a date of §76(ב)` 7000 17 (`the salary month` 2008 1) EQUALS 8312.85
#ASSERT `A at a date of §76(ב)` 7000 17 (`the salary month` 2010 1) EQUALS 8599.5

-- (3): the 1.5% of 1.12.08 on the new table needs no new conversion, only
-- the updated cell: "8,498 כפול (101.5%) = 8,625.22". F-ofek-hadash-
-- founding-2007-h: 8,498 × 101.5% is 8,625.47. The reading adopted
-- (convention precedence.example): the rule — the cell raised by 1.5%.
@ref akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_3 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_3__cls_a/p2 akn:art_36__para_c__subpara_3__cls_a/p3
#ASSERT `a new table's cell on` 8498 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2008) EQUALS 8625.47

`the example's 8,625.22 is not 8,498 raised by 1.5%` MEANS
        (NOT (`to the agora` (8498 TIMES 101.5%) EQUALS 8625.22))
    AND `to the agora` (8498 TIMES 101.5%) EQUALS 8625.47
#ASSERT `the example's 8,625.22 is not 8,498 raised by 1.5%`

-- The footnote: the example leaves out a promotion between the first
-- conversion and the last; one promoted in between is placed, after these
-- steps, at the grade or intermediate grade closest from above in the grade
-- he was promoted to, by his seniority row.
@ref akn:art_36/p1
GIVEN `the row of the grade promoted to, intermediate grades included` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the placement of one promoted between the conversions` `the row of the grade promoted to, intermediate grades included` a IS
    `the cell closest to A from above` `the row of the grade promoted to, intermediate grades included` a

§§ `37 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה לדרגה השלמה הקרובה`

-- (א): at the placement of §35, a teacher placed at a whole grade has spent
-- 0 years in it; at an intermediate grade between 0 and 2, a year; between
-- 2 and 8, a year and a half.
@ref akn:art_37 akn:art_37__para_a akn:art_37__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_37__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_37__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years a converted teacher is taken to have spent at placement` grade IS
    IF FLOOR grade EQUALS grade THEN 0
    ELSE (IF grade LESS THAN 2 THEN 1 ELSE 1.5)

#ASSERT `years a converted teacher is taken to have spent at placement` 3 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `years a converted teacher is taken to have spent at placement` 0.5 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `years a converted teacher is taken to have spent at placement` 3.5 EQUALS 1.5

-- (ב): the first promotion to the whole grades 1–5 is §28(א)–(ב)'s, the
-- criteria of 28(א)(2) fitted to the time left in an intermediate grade;
-- (ג): to grades 6–8, after the conversion and for that only, the years and
-- the criteria of 28(ה)(1)–(2), without the evaluation of (3).
@ref akn:art_37__para_b akn:art_37__para_c
GIVEN c IS A `candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the conditions of the first promotion after conversion` c IF
    `meets the conditions for the next grade`
        (`candidate` WITH
            grade                             IS c's grade
            `periods in the grade`            IS c's `periods in the grade`
            `meets the Ministry's criteria`   IS c's `meets the Ministry's criteria`
            `evaluation recommends promotion` IS TRUE
            `evaluation score`                IS c's `evaluation score`)

§§ `38 המרה למורים המלמדים בבית-ספר יסודי לפי בסיס משרה של חטיבת ביניים`

-- (א)–(ב): the conversion of a teacher in grades 7–9 of a primary school on
-- the 24-hour base in the year of the determining month, and of one in
-- grades 1–6 whose base was kept at 24 hours (§15), is a junior-high
-- teacher's, with Y "גדול ב- 12.5% מהתוספת הקבועה בסעיף 34".
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-i: the clause's own example adds 12.5 points
-- (27 + 12.5); convention amounts.increase would multiply (27 × 1.125). The
-- example decides the reading here: an exception to the convention,
-- recorded there.
@ref akn:art_38 akn:art_38__para_a akn:art_38__para_b
GIVEN s IS A `status`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y on the 24-hour base in a primary school` s IS
    `Y on a single base` s `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours` PLUS 12.5

-- (ג): on both bases in a primary school, the weighted Y of §34, the
-- 24-hour share at the raised Y.
@ref akn:art_38__para_c
GIVEN s IS A `status`, `position on the 24-hour base` IS A NUMBER, `position on the 30-hour base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y on both bases in a primary school` s `position on the 24-hour base` `position on the 30-hour base` IS
    (    `position on the 24-hour base` TIMES `Y on the 24-hour base in a primary school` s
     PLUS `position on the 30-hour base` TIMES `Y on a single base` s `the primary base of 30 weekly hours`)
    DIVIDED BY (`position on the 24-hour base` PLUS `position on the 30-hour base`)

-- The example (¶1–¶3): a regular teacher, 70% in grades 1–6 and 40% in
-- grades 7–9, 110% in all: (70/110 × 117%) + (40/110 × 139.5%), printed as
-- Y = 25.18.
@ref akn:art_38/p1 akn:art_38/p2 akn:art_38/p3
#ASSERT `to the agora` (`Y on both bases in a primary school` `regular teacher` 0.4 0.7) EQUALS 25.18

`Y by convention amounts.increase` MEANS
    (0.4 TIMES (27 `increased by` (12.5%)) PLUS 0.7 TIMES 17) DIVIDED BY 1.1
`the example adds points, not a share` MEANS
    NOT (`to the agora` `Y by convention amounts.increase` EQUALS 25.18)
#ASSERT `the example adds points, not a share`

§§ `39`

-- §39: after this part, §§28–32 apply to the converted academic teacher.
@ref akn:art_39
`sections 28 to 32 apply after the conversion` MEANS TRUE

§ `ט. מורים שאינם אקדמאים`

-- akn:part_9 The heading of part I (non-academic teachers); its article follows.

§§ `40 בקשה לעבור לרפורמה והתחייבות להשלמת השכלה`

DECLARE `non-academic action` IS ONE OF
    `choose to stay on the existing structure or move to the reform`
    `sign the undertaking to complete an academic degree by the start of 5773`

-- (א): a non-academic teacher in a reform school may choose to stay on the
-- existing structure and pay or to move to the reform.
@ref akn:art_40 akn:art_40__para_a
`a non-academic teacher's choice` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `choose to stay on the existing structure or move to the reform`

-- (ב): one who asks to move must sign an undertaking to complete his
-- academic education by the start of 5773 (1.9.2012, convention
-- dates.school-year); its wording is annex ז' (not in this document).
@ref akn:art_40__para_b
`the start of 5773` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012

`the undertaking of a non-academic who moves` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `sign the undertaking to complete an academic degree by the start of 5773`

-- (ג): the terms of this agreement for non-academic teachers apply to one
-- who signed it.
@ref akn:art_40__para_c
GIVEN `asked to move` IS A BOOLEAN, `signed the undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `on the reform's non-academic terms` `asked to move` `signed the undertaking` IF
    `asked to move` AND `signed the undertaking`

§ `י. המרת שכר למורים שאינם אקדמאים`

-- akn:part_10 The heading of part J (the salary conversion of non-academic teachers); its articles follow.

§§ `41 ההמרה`

-- §41: by the rules of an existing academic teacher's conversion.
@ref akn:art_41 akn:art_41/p1
`a non-academic converts by the academic rules, save the formula` MEANS TRUE

§§ `42 נוסחת ההמרה למורה שאינו אקדמאי`

-- §42: "the conversion formula of §31" applies, with A = X × (100 + Y ×
-- 0.8)% — printed as article 43's heading. F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-j:
-- §31 is about the role allowances that end; the formula is §34's, and the
-- agreement points to "§31" for it three times (§§42, 50(ד), 75(ב)). The
-- reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): §34.
@ref akn:art_42 akn:art_42/p1 akn:art_42/p2 akn:art_43
`the non-academic's multiplier of Y` MEANS 0.8

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A for a non-academic` x y IS
    x TIMES (100 PLUS y TIMES `the non-academic's multiplier of Y`) DIVIDED BY 100

#ASSERT `A for a non-academic` 5500 17 EQUALS 6248

`the section that sets the conversion formula` MEANS 34
`the sections §§42, 50(ד) and 75(ב) name for it` MEANS LIST 31, 31, 31
`three references send the conversion formula to §31` MEANS
    all (GIVEN n YIELD NOT n EQUALS `the section that sets the conversion formula`) `the sections §§42, 50(ד) and 75(ב) name for it`
#ASSERT `three references send the conversion formula to §31`

§§ `43 שיבוץ מורה שאינו אקדמאי בטבלאות השכר המשולב`

DECLARE `non-academic rank` IS ONE OF
    `the senior certified rank`
    `the certified rank`
    `the uncertified teachers' and instructors' ranks`

DECLARE `non-academic table` IS ONE OF
    `the new table for senior certified teachers`
    `the new table for certified teachers`
    `the new table for uncertified teachers`

-- ¶1–¶2 and (א)–(ג): placed in the relevant new table (annexes ח'–י', not
-- in this document), in the row of his seniority at the conversion, at the
-- grade or intermediate grade closest to A from above; the senior certified
-- in the senior certified teachers' table, the certified in the certified
-- teachers', the uncertified teachers and instructors in the uncertified
-- teachers'.
@ref akn:art_43/p1 akn:art_43/p2 akn:art_43__para_a akn:art_43__para_b akn:art_43__para_c
GIVEN r IS A `non-academic rank`
GIVETH A `non-academic table`
DECIDE `the table a non-academic is placed in` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the senior certified rank` THEN `the new table for senior certified teachers`
    WHEN `the certified rank` THEN `the new table for certified teachers`
    WHEN `the uncertified teachers' and instructors' ranks` THEN `the new table for uncertified teachers`

GIVEN `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      x IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the non-academic placement` `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` x y IS
    `the cell closest to A from above` `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` (`A for a non-academic` x y)

§ `יא. קידום רעיוני בדרגות למורה שאינו אקדמאי`

-- akn:part_11 The heading of part K (notional promotion of a non-academic teacher); its article follows.

§§ `44`

-- akn:art_44 The article's number line; (א)–(ג) follow.

-- (א): a non-academic who moved under §40 advances in the grades of his
-- table (§43), but is not paid the grade he advanced to until the date of
-- his degree; ¶2 leaves that date to the comprehensive agreement. (ב): the
-- notional promotion runs as if he had been placed by the full Y (not
-- times 0.8). (ג): its conditions are an academic teacher's, §28(א)–(ד).
@ref akn:art_44__para_a akn:art_44__para_a/p2 akn:art_44__para_b akn:art_44__para_c
GIVEN `the grade he is placed at` IS A NUMBER, `the grade he advanced to, notionally` IS A NUMBER, `has his degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade a non-academic is paid at` `the grade he is placed at` `the grade he advanced to, notionally` `has his degree` IS
    IF `has his degree` THEN `the grade he advanced to, notionally` ELSE `the grade he is placed at`

GIVEN `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      x IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `the placement the notional promotion runs from` `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` x y IS
    `the cell closest to A from above` `the row of his seniority in his table, intermediate grades included` (`A, the converted pay` x y)

#ASSERT `the grade a non-academic is paid at` 3.5 5 FALSE EQUALS 3.5

§ `יב. הפרשי שכר ושיבוץ בטבלת השכר למורים אקדמאים לאחר השלמת התואר`

-- akn:part_12 The heading of part L (salary differences and placement in the academic table after the degree); its articles follow.

§§ `45 הפרשי שכר`

-- ¶1: from the date of the degree, provided it is by the start of 5773
-- (convention dates.end), the teacher is paid differences.
@ref akn:art_45 akn:art_45/p1
GIVEN `the date of the degree` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the differences` `the date of the degree` IF
    `the date of the degree` `is on or before` `the start of 5773`

#ASSERT NOT `entitled to the differences` (DATE_FROM_DMY 2 9 2012)

-- (א): for each month from the conversion to the degree, the difference,
-- if any, between the salary a conversion by the full Y would have given
-- and the salary he was placed at, in "the table … as in §43(א)".
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-k: §43(א) is the senior certified teachers'
-- table only; a certified or uncertified teacher is placed in his own
-- (§43(ב)–(ג)). The reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): the
-- teacher's own table under §43.
@ref akn:art_45__para_a
GIVEN `salary by the full Y` IS A NUMBER, `salary as placed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly difference for the coefficient` `salary by the full Y` `salary as placed` IS
    `not below zero` (`salary by the full Y` MINUS `salary as placed`)

`the table 45(א) names` MEANS `the table a non-academic is placed in` `the senior certified rank`
`45(א) names the senior certified table for every non-academic` MEANS
        (NOT (`the table 45(א) names` EQUALS `the table a non-academic is placed in` `the certified rank`))
    AND (NOT (`the table 45(א) names` EQUALS `the table a non-academic is placed in` `the uncertified teachers' and instructors' ranks`))
#ASSERT `45(א) names the senior certified table for every non-academic`

-- (ב): for a notional promotion (§44), the differences of the promotion,
-- back from the day he was entitled to it.
@ref akn:art_45__para_b
GIVEN `salary in the grade promoted to` IS A NUMBER, `salary in the grade paid` IS A NUMBER, `months from the entitlement to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the differences of a notional promotion` `salary in the grade promoted to` `salary in the grade paid` `months from the entitlement to the degree` IS
    `not below zero` (`salary in the grade promoted to` MINUS `salary in the grade paid`) TIMES `months from the entitlement to the degree`

§§ `46 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר למורים אקדמאיים`

-- akn:art_46 The article's heading: placement in the academic teachers' table.
-- akn:art_46/p1 The opening: how a non-academic who completed a degree is placed; (א)–(ג) follow.

-- (א): the coefficient for the BA table: "מכפלת מקדם ההמרה המלא (Y)" by the
-- rate of the step for each year of seniority from the conversion to the
-- degree, by the rate of the notional grade promotions to the degree, and
-- by the addition for the degree: 5% for a senior certified teacher, 15%
-- for a certified one, 25% for an uncertified teacher or instructor. The
-- steps are the tables' (inputs). F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-l: Y is "the
-- rate of the addition (in percent)" (§34), and a product with 17% for a
-- factor is a fifth of the pay; the example (§47(ב)(4)) multiplies by 1.17,
-- (100 + Y)%. The reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): (100 + Y)%.
@ref akn:art_46__para_a akn:art_46__para_a/p2 akn:art_46__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_46__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_46__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `non-academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the degree addition` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the senior certified rank` THEN 5%
    WHEN `the certified rank` THEN 15%
    WHEN `the uncertified teachers' and instructors' ranks` THEN 25%

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `the seniority steps, one a year to the degree` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `the notional grade steps` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      r IS A `non-academic rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coefficient for the BA table` y `the seniority steps, one a year to the degree` `the notional grade steps` r IS
        (100 PLUS y) DIVIDED BY 100
    TIMES product (map (GIVEN s YIELD 1 PLUS s) `the seniority steps, one a year to the degree`)
    TIMES product (map (GIVEN s YIELD 1 PLUS s) `the notional grade steps`)
    TIMES (1 PLUS `the degree addition` r)

`the product with Y as printed is a fifth of the pay` MEANS
    17% TIMES 1.01 TIMES 1.075 TIMES 1.05 LESS THAN 0.2
#ASSERT `the product with Y as printed is a fifth of the pay`

-- (ב): the salary to convert to the BA table is X on the day of the move
-- times that coefficient. (ג): placed in the new academic table by his
-- seniority, at the whole or intermediate grade closest to it from above.
@ref akn:art_46__para_b akn:art_46__para_b/p2 akn:art_46__para_c
GIVEN `X on the day of the move` IS A NUMBER, coefficient IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A for the BA table` `X on the day of the move` coefficient IS
    `X on the day of the move` TIMES coefficient

§§ `47`

-- ¶1: §§45–46 do not apply to a non-academic who moved and did not
-- complete an academic education.
@ref akn:art_47
GIVEN `completed an academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections 45 and 46 apply` `completed an academic degree` IF
    `completed an academic degree`

-- The example (¶2–¶5, (א), (ב)(1)–(3)): a senior certified teacher, 100%,
-- seniority 15, primary, moving in September 2007, the degree four years
-- later; X = 5,500, Y = 17%. A = 6,248, placed at 6,310 (grade 3.5); by the
-- full Y, A = 6,435, at 6,538 (grade 4); the differences 228, 231, 233 and
-- 235 a month in seniority 15–18; the promotion from grade 4 to 5 after
-- three years, 7,242 − 6,736 = 506 a month.
@ref akn:art_47/p2 akn:art_47/p3 akn:art_47/p4 akn:art_47/p5 akn:art_47__para_a akn:art_47__para_a/p2 akn:art_47__para_a/p3 akn:art_47__para_a/p4 akn:art_47__para_a/p5 akn:art_47__para_b akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_2/p5 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_3/p3 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_3/p4 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_3/p5
#ASSERT `A for a non-academic` 5500 17 EQUALS 6248
#ASSERT `A, the converted pay` 5500 17 EQUALS 6435
#ASSERT `the non-academic placement` (LIST `a cell` 3 6200, `a cell` 3.5 6310, `a cell` 4 6538) 5500 17 EQUALS `a cell` 3.5 6310
#ASSERT `the placement the notional promotion runs from` (LIST `a cell` 3 6200, `a cell` 3.5 6310, `a cell` 4 6538) 5500 17 EQUALS `a cell` 4 6538
#ASSERT map (GIVEN p YIELD `the monthly difference for the coefficient` (fst p) (snd p)) (LIST PAIR 6538 6310, PAIR 6604 6373, PAIR 6670 6437, PAIR 6736 6501) EQUALS LIST 228, 231, 233, 235
#ASSERT `the differences of a notional promotion` 7242 6736 1 EQUALS 506

-- (ב)(4): the coefficient: 1.17 × 1.01 × 1.01 × 1.01 × 1.075 × 1.05 = 1.36
-- — the full Y, a 1% step "for each year of seniority", the grade's 7.5%,
-- the degree's 5% — and A = 5,500 × 1.36 = 7,480, placed at 7,501 (grade
-- 1.5). F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-m: the degree comes four years after
-- the conversion (the differences run through seniority 15 to 18, a year
-- each), and (א) of §46 multiplies by the step of "כל שנת ותק שנצברה ממועד
-- ההמרה עד מועד התואר"; the example multiplies by three. The reading
-- adopted (convention precedence.example): the rule — a step for each year
-- accrued, an input, which over four years gives 1.37.
@ref akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_a akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_a/p2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_a/p3 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_b akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_b/p2 akn:art_47__para_b__subpara_4__cls_c
`the example's coefficient, three steps of seniority` MEANS
    `the coefficient for the BA table` 17 (LIST 1%, 1%, 1%) (LIST 7.5%) `the senior certified rank`
`the coefficient over four years of seniority` MEANS
    `the coefficient for the BA table` 17 (LIST 1%, 1%, 1%, 1%) (LIST 7.5%) `the senior certified rank`

#ASSERT `the example's coefficient, three steps of seniority` `to the nearest` 0.01 EQUALS 1.36
#ASSERT `A for the BA table` 5500 1.36 EQUALS 7480

`the example steps three years of seniority for four` MEANS
        `the example's coefficient, three steps of seniority` `to the nearest` 0.01 EQUALS 1.36
    AND `the coefficient over four years of seniority` `to the nearest` 0.01 EQUALS 1.37
#ASSERT `the example steps three years of seniority for four`

-- akn:art_47/p6 The example's simplification: only the annexes' tables, not updated, and X not raised; no rule.

§ `יג. שבוע העבודה של מנהלי בתי ספר`

-- akn:part_13 The heading of part M (the principals' work week); its articles follow.

§§ `48 היקף שבוע העבודה של מנהל בית ספר במשרה מלאה`

@ref akn:art_48 akn:art_48__para_a akn:art_48__para_b
`a principal's week, in hours` MEANS 40
`a principal's working days a week in a full position` MEANS 5

§§ `49 שעות הוראה פרונטאליות למנהלים`

-- ¶1 and the table: a principal's weekly frontal teaching hours by the
-- school's complexity level: 1 → 11, 2 → 9, 3 → 7, 4 → 6.
@ref akn:art_49 akn:art_49/p1 akn:art_49/t1
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's frontal hours` level IS
    BRANCH IF level EQUALS 1 THEN 11
           IF level EQUALS 2 THEN 9
           IF level EQUALS 3 THEN 7
           OTHERWISE 6

#ASSERT map `a principal's frontal hours` (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4) EQUALS LIST 11, 9, 7, 6

§ `יד. שכר מנהלי בתי ספר`

-- akn:part_14 The heading of part N (principals' salary); its articles follow.

DECLARE `appointee` IS ONE OF
    `new to the post, in a reform school`
    `a teaching employee on the reform's terms`
    `a teaching employee off the reform, in a reform school`
    `a teaching employee off the reform, in a school without it`

DECLARE `placement in a managers' table` IS ONE OF
    `grade 1 at the school's complexity level`
    `closest from above to the last table salary`
    `closest from above to X`
    `the existing agreements`

§§ `50 שכר מנהלים חדשים`

-- (א)–(ב): a principal new to the post in a reform school is paid by the
-- table of annex יא' (not in this document), placed at grade 1 at his
-- school's complexity level; in 5768 a full-position grade-1 principal
-- earns no less than 12,200. (ג): a reform teacher appointed principal, in
-- a reform school or not, at the grade closest from above to his last
-- table salary. (ד): a teacher off the reform appointed in a reform school,
-- at the grade closest from above to X "כאמור בסעיף 31" (§34's X:
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-j). (ה): off the reform and in a school
-- without it, the existing agreements.
@ref akn:art_50 akn:art_50__para_a akn:art_50__para_b akn:art_50__para_c akn:art_50__para_d akn:art_50__para_e
GIVEN a IS AN `appointee`
GIVETH A `placement in a managers' table`
DECIDE `a new principal's placement` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `new to the post, in a reform school` THEN `grade 1 at the school's complexity level`
    WHEN `a teaching employee on the reform's terms` THEN `closest from above to the last table salary`
    WHEN `a teaching employee off the reform, in a reform school` THEN `closest from above to X`
    WHEN `a teaching employee off the reform, in a school without it` THEN `the existing agreements`

`the 5768 floor of a full-position grade-1 principal` MEANS 12200

GIVEN `the table's grade-1 cell` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a grade-1 principal's 5768 salary` `the table's grade-1 cell` IS
    max `the table's grade-1 cell` `the 5768 floor of a full-position grade-1 principal`

§§ `51 קביעת רמת מורכבות לבית ספר`

DECLARE `complexity action` IS ONE OF
    `notify the union of the schools' complexity levels`

-- (א): the Ministry sets a complexity level of 1–4 for every primary and
-- junior high school, and notifies the union by 30 June each year, whether
-- or not a level changed; for 5768, by 31.10.07.
@ref akn:art_51 akn:art_51__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the last day to notify the complexity levels for the school year from` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2007 THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2007 ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 y

`days from the signing to 31.10.07` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 2007) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing date`

`notifying the 5768 complexity levels` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `notify the union of the schools' complexity levels`
    WITHIN `days from the signing to 31.10.07`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "§51(א): the complexity levels of 5768 are notified by 31.10.07"

#ASSERT `days from the signing to 31.10.07` EQUALS 51
#ASSERT `the last day to notify the complexity levels for the school year from` 2009 EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2009

-- (ב): the parameters the level takes into account.
@ref akn:art_51__para_b akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_5
DECLARE `complexity parameter` IS ONE OF
    `the number of pupils`
    `the number of standard classes`
    `the nurture index`
    `special classes in a regular school`
    `the stage of education`

-- (ג): in 5768 the schools divide by level 16%, 34%, 34%, 16%; ¶2: a
-- school's level set at the start of 5768 does not change during it.
@ref akn:art_51__para_c akn:art_51__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_51__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_51__para_c__subpara_3 akn:art_51__para_c__subpara_4 akn:art_51/p1
GIVEN level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5768 share of schools at level` level IS
    IF level EQUALS 1 OR level EQUALS 4 THEN 16% ELSE 34%

#ASSERT sum (map `the 5768 share of schools at level` (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4)) EQUALS 1

`a school's level changes during 5768` MEANS FALSE

§§ `52 מנהלים המועסקים לפי תנאי הרפורמה – קידום בדרגות`

-- ¶1, (א)–(ג): a principal is promoted on three years in the grade below,
-- the Ministry's criteria (to be set out in a letter to the union), and an
-- evaluation, under the Ministry's directions with RAMA, that recommends
-- it.
@ref akn:art_52 akn:art_52/p1 akn:art_52__para_a akn:art_52__para_b akn:art_52__para_c
`years in the grade below for a manager's promotion` MEANS 3

GIVEN `years in the grade` IS A NUMBER, `meets the Ministry's criteria` IS A BOOLEAN, `evaluation recommends promotion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a manager meets the conditions for the next grade` `years in the grade` `meets the Ministry's criteria` `evaluation recommends promotion` IF
        `years in the grade` AT LEAST `years in the grade below for a manager's promotion`
    AND `meets the Ministry's criteria`
    AND `evaluation recommends promotion`

#ASSERT NOT `a manager meets the conditions for the next grade` 2.5 TRUE TRUE

§ `טו. המרת השכר למנהלים הקיימים`

-- akn:part_15 The heading of part O (the salary conversion of existing principals); its articles follow.

§§ `53`

-- §53: every existing principal must move to the reform's structure when
-- it comes to his school, and his salary is converted.
@ref akn:art_53
GIVEN `the reform came to his school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing principal moves` `the reform came to his school` IF
    `the reform came to his school`

§§ `54 נוסחת ההמרה`

DECLARE `the manager's state in the determining month` IS ONE OF
    `at work as manager`
    `on unpaid leave or a sabbatical on the eve of the reform in the school`
    `on maternity leave or reserve duty in March as manager`

DECLARE `month of a manager's X or T` IS ONE OF
    `March of the school year before the move, for a manager`
    `March of the school year before the unpaid leave, for a manager`

-- ¶1–¶4: X is the pay, without refunds of expenses, yearly payments, tax
-- gross-up and benefit imputation, of a 100% position by the principal's
-- roles, in the March salary of the year before the move; on unpaid leave
-- or a sabbatical on the eve, the March before the leave; on maternity
-- leave or reserve duty in March, the 100% pay but for it.
@ref akn:art_54 akn:art_54/p1 akn:art_54/p2 akn:art_54/p3 akn:art_54/p4
GIVEN s IS A `the manager's state in the determining month`
GIVETH A `month of a manager's X or T`
DECIDE `the month a manager's X or T is taken from` s IS
    IF s EQUALS `on unpaid leave or a sabbatical on the eve of the reform in the school`
    THEN `March of the school year before the unpaid leave, for a manager`
    ELSE `March of the school year before the move, for a manager`

DECLARE `manager's pay item` IS ONE OF
    `pay for the roles`
    `a refund of expenses`
    `a yearly payment`
    `tax gross-up`
    `benefit imputed for tax`

GIVEN i IS A `manager's pay item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in a manager's X or T` i IF
    i EQUALS `pay for the roles`

-- ¶5–¶9: Y is 15%, and A = X × (100 + Y)%.
@ref akn:art_54/p5 akn:art_54/p6 akn:art_54/p7 akn:art_54/p8 akn:art_54/p9
`a principal's Y` MEANS 15

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a principal's A` x IS
    `A, the converted pay` x `a principal's Y`

§§ `55 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר המשולב למנהלים`

-- (א): for the conversion only, the principals' table carries intermediate
-- grades: annex יב' (not in this document). (ב): the principal is placed at
-- his school's complexity level at the grade or intermediate grade closest
-- to A from above; (ג): above grade 4, the top of the row, at grade 4.
@ref akn:art_55 akn:art_55__para_a akn:art_55__para_b akn:art_55__para_c
GIVEN `the row of his school's level, intermediate grades included` IS A LIST OF `table cell`
      x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `table cell`
DECIDE `a converted principal's placement` `the row of his school's level, intermediate grades included` x IS
    `the cell closest to A from above` `the row of his school's level, intermediate grades included` (`a principal's A` x)

§§ `56 תוספת אישית אחוזית למנהל קיים במעבר לרפורמה`

-- (א) ¶1–¶4: a personal percentage supplement; T is the principal's pay,
-- without refunds, yearly payments, gross-up and benefit, "במלוא היקף
-- משרתו" in March of the year before the move; on unpaid leave or a
-- sabbatical, the March before the leave; and on maternity leave or reserve
-- duty in March, the pay "בשל העסקה ב- 100% משרה" but for it.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-n: T is the pay of the whole position, which
-- may be above 100%, and the one on leave is measured at 100%; a principal
-- of 120% on maternity leave in March gets a T a sixth lower than had she
-- worked. The reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): the
-- paragraph on leave governs the one on leave — her T at 100%.
@ref akn:art_56 akn:art_56__para_a akn:art_56__para_a/p2 akn:art_56__para_a/p3 akn:art_56__para_a/p4
GIVEN `on maternity leave or reserve duty in March` IS A BOOLEAN, `the whole position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position T is taken at` `on maternity leave or reserve duty in March` `the whole position` IS
    IF `on maternity leave or reserve duty in March` THEN 1 ELSE `the whole position`

`T on leave is a 100% position's pay, T at work the whole position's` MEANS
        `the position T is taken at` TRUE 1.2 EQUALS 1
    AND `the position T is taken at` FALSE 1.2 EQUALS 1.2
#ASSERT `T on leave is a 100% position's pay, T at work the whole position's`

-- (א) ¶5–¶8: B = T × (Y + 100)%; "C = שכר טבלאי חדש - B", the shekel
-- supplement turned into a percentage of the combined salary.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-o: B is what the old pay comes to with the
-- addition and is above the new table pay where a supplement is due, so C
-- as printed is negative; the example (§57(ב)(4)) computes B less the
-- table pay, 17,250 − 14,600 = 2,650. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.misprint): C = B − the new table pay, never below nothing
-- (convention amounts.never-negative); no rounding is stated (convention
-- rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_56__para_a/p5 akn:art_56__para_a/p6 akn:art_56__para_a/p7 akn:art_56__para_a/p8
GIVEN t IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `B, the old pay with the addition` t y IS
    `A, the converted pay` t y

GIVEN t IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `new table pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the personal supplement rate` t y `new table pay` IS
    `not below zero` (`B, the old pay with the addition` t y MINUS `new table pay`) DIVIDED BY `new table pay`

`C as printed is negative where the example's supplement is positive` MEANS
        14600 MINUS `B, the old pay with the addition` 15000 15 LESS THAN 0
    AND `B, the old pay with the addition` 15000 15 MINUS 14600 EQUALS 2650
#ASSERT `C as printed is negative where the example's supplement is positive`

-- (ג): not a permanent supplement for the budgetary pension's determining
-- salary, and no accrual-pension contributions on it; (ד): contributions
-- to the "Dafna" provident fund and to a study fund on it; (ה): this takes
-- nothing from the Supervision of Financial Services (Provident Funds)
-- Law, 2005.
@ref akn:art_56__para_c
`the personal supplement is pensionable` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_56__para_d
DECLARE `fund` IS ONE OF
    `the Dafna provident fund`
    `a study fund`
    `an accrual pension fund`

GIVEN f IS A `fund`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `contributions on the personal supplement go to` f IF
    NOT f EQUALS `an accrual pension fund`

@ref akn:art_56__para_e
`section 56 takes away from the provident funds law` MEANS FALSE

§§ `57 קידום ראשון לאחר ההמרה`

-- (א): "בעת השיבוץ כאמור בסעיף __ לעיל" — the number is left blank.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-p: the placement it speaks of is §55's. The
-- reading adopted (convention reading.misprint): §55. A principal placed
-- at a whole grade has spent 0 years in it, at an intermediate grade a
-- year and a half.
@ref akn:art_57 akn:art_57__para_a akn:art_57__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_57__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN grade IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years a manager is taken to have spent at placement` grade IS
    IF FLOOR grade EQUALS grade THEN 0 ELSE 1.5

`the section 57(א) prints` MEANS "__"
`57(א) leaves its section blank` MEANS `the section 57(א) prints` EQUALS "__"
#ASSERT `57(א) leaves its section blank`
#ASSERT `years a manager is taken to have spent at placement` 2.5 EQUALS 1.5

-- (ב): the first promotion after the conversion is "סעיף 49"'s, the
-- criteria of "49(ב)" fitted to the time left in an intermediate grade.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-q: §49 is the principals' frontal hours; the
-- promotion and its criteria are §52's (and, for first deputies, §67(ב)
-- names §59, the deputies' week, for §62). The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.misprint): §52, and §62 for first deputies.
@ref akn:art_57__para_b
`the first promotion after conversion follows section 52` MEANS TRUE

`the section that sets a principal's promotion` MEANS 52
`the section 57(ב) names` MEANS 49
`the section that sets a first deputy's promotion` MEANS 62
`the section 67(ב) names` MEANS 59
`57(ב) and 67(ב) send the promotion to the week's sections` MEANS
        (NOT (`the section 57(ב) names` EQUALS `the section that sets a principal's promotion`))
    AND (NOT (`the section 67(ב) names` EQUALS `the section that sets a first deputy's promotion`))
    AND `a principal's frontal hours` 3 EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `57(ב) and 67(ב) send the promotion to the week's sections`

-- The example ((ב) ¶2 to (4)): 120%, level 3, T = 15,000. X = 15,000 /
-- 120% = 12,500; A = 14,375; placed at 14,600 (grade 1); B = 17,250; C =
-- 2,650; 2,650 / 14,600 = 18.15%.
@ref akn:art_57__para_b/p2 akn:art_57__para_b/p3 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4/p2 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4/p3 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4/p4 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4/p5 akn:art_57__para_b__subpara_4/p6
#ASSERT 15000 DIVIDED BY 1.2 EQUALS 12500
#ASSERT `a principal's A` 12500 EQUALS 14375
#ASSERT `a converted principal's placement` (LIST `a cell` 1 14600, `a cell` 1.5 15000) 12500 EQUALS `a cell` 1 14600
#ASSERT `B, the old pay with the addition` 15000 15 EQUALS 17250
#ASSERT (`the personal supplement rate` 15000 15 14600) `to the nearest` 0.0001 EQUALS 18.15%

§ `טז. אופן ההעסקה של מנהלי בתי-ספר`

-- akn:part_16 The heading of part P (how principals are employed); its article follows.

§§ `58 מינוי לקדנציה ושיבוץ נוסף`

-- (א): a teaching employee chosen by tender as principal, from 5768, is
-- appointed for ten years; (ב): for an existing principal the term starts
-- on the day he moves to the reform's terms.
@ref akn:art_58 akn:art_58__para_a akn:art_58__para_b
`a principal's term, in years` MEANS 10

GIVEN `chosen by tender from 5768` IS A BOOLEAN, `appointed on` IS A DATE, `moved to the reform on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the principal's term starts on` `chosen by tender from 5768` `appointed on` `moved to the reform on` IS
    IF `chosen by tender from 5768` THEN `appointed on` ELSE `moved to the reform on`

DECLARE `evaluation action` IS ONE OF
    `set the mechanism for evaluating the principal, with RAMA, after consulting the union`
    `evaluate the principal during the term`

-- (ג): the principal is evaluated during the term; the mechanism is the
-- Ministry's, with RAMA, after consulting the union first. No deadline is
-- set beyond the term (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_58__para_c
`evaluating the principal` MEANS
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `set the mechanism for evaluating the principal, with RAMA, after consulting the union`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `evaluate the principal during the term`)

-- akn:art_58__para_d Employment beyond the term is left to the comprehensive agreement; no rule.
-- akn:art_58__para_d/p2 The union's position (automatic placement at the end of the term); a position, no rule.
-- akn:art_58__para_d/p3 The State's position (extension by the evaluation, in another school or exceptionally the same); a position, no rule.

§ `יז. שבוע העבודה של סגני מנהלים`

-- akn:part_17 The heading of part Q (the deputies' work week); its articles follow.

§§ `59 שבוע העבודה של סגן ראשון`

-- (א): a first deputy's week in a primary or junior high school is 40
-- hours. (ב) and its tables: the weekly frontal hours by the school's
-- complexity level — primary 21, 20, 19, 19; junior high 11, 11, 9, 9.
@ref akn:art_59 akn:art_59__para_a
`a first deputy's week, in hours` MEANS 40

@ref akn:art_59__para_b akn:art_59__para_b/p2 akn:art_59__para_b/t1 akn:art_59__para_b/p3 akn:art_59__para_b/t2
GIVEN s IS A `school kind`, level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's frontal hours` s level IS
    IF s EQUALS `a junior high school`
    THEN (IF level AT MOST 2 THEN 11 ELSE 9)
    ELSE (BRANCH IF level EQUALS 1 THEN 21
                 IF level EQUALS 2 THEN 20
                 OTHERWISE 19)

#ASSERT map (GIVEN l YIELD `a first deputy's frontal hours` `a primary school` l) (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4) EQUALS LIST 21, 20, 19, 19
