§§ `74 גמול ייעוץ`

DECLARE `counselling licence` IS ONE OF `a temporary licence`, `a permanent licence`

-- ¶1: for at least 7 counselling hours; (א)–(ב): at most 6% with a
-- temporary licence, 9% with a permanent one.
@ref akn:art_74 akn:art_74/p1
`counselling hours an allowance asks at least` MEANS 7

@ref akn:art_74__para_a akn:art_74__para_b
GIVEN l IS A `counselling licence`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the maximum counselling rate` l IS
    IF l EQUALS `a permanent licence` THEN 9% ELSE 6%

@desc A counsellor's hours, as §74(ג) counts them.
DECLARE `counsellor's hours` HAS
    X IS A NUMBER @desc frontal teaching hours in fact
    Y IS A NUMBER @desc counselling hours in fact
    Z IS A NUMBER @desc all the hours of the position, individual and stay hours included (by annexes א' and ב')

-- (ג) ¶1–¶11: "מספר שעות הייעוץ" = Z × Y / (X + Y), X + Y being the
-- position's frontal hours (26 in a full primary position, 23 in a junior
-- high one); the rate is the maximum times that number over 16, the number
-- never above 16. No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_74__para_c akn:art_74__para_c/p2 akn:art_74__para_c/p3 akn:art_74__para_c/p4 akn:art_74__para_c/p5 akn:art_74__para_c/p6 akn:art_74__para_c/p7 akn:art_74__para_c/p8 akn:art_74__para_c/p9 akn:art_74__para_c/p10 akn:art_74__para_c/p11
GIVEN h IS A `counsellor's hours`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the number of counselling hours` h IS
    IF h's X PLUS h's Y GREATER THAN 0
    THEN min 16 (h's Z TIMES h's Y DIVIDED BY (h's X PLUS h's Y))
    ELSE 0

GIVEN l IS A `counselling licence`, h IS A `counsellor's hours`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counselling rate` l h IS
    IF h's Y AT LEAST `counselling hours an allowance asks at least`
    THEN `the maximum counselling rate` l TIMES `the number of counselling hours` h DIVIDED BY 16
    ELSE 0

-- The example (¶12 to (2)): a permanent licence, a primary school, 14
-- frontal and 10 counselling hours, X + Y = 24 (a 93% position by annex
-- א'), Z = 34. The text prints 14.16 (34 × 10 / 24 is 14.1666…, cut at the
-- second place) and 7.97% (14.16 × 9 / 16 is 7.965, to the nearer
-- hundredth); the exact rule gives 7.96875%, which prints as the same 7.97
-- (convention rounding.printed-figure: the check rounds, the rule does
-- not).
@ref akn:art_74__para_c/p12 akn:art_74__para_c/p13 akn:art_74__para_c/p14 akn:art_74__para_c/p15 akn:art_74__para_c/p16 akn:art_74__para_c/p17 akn:art_74__para_c/p18 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_74__para_c__subpara_2/p3
`the example's counsellor` MEANS
    `counsellor's hours` WITH
        X IS 14
        Y IS 10
        Z IS 34

#ASSERT `truncated to the agora` (`the number of counselling hours` `the example's counsellor`) EQUALS 14.16
#ASSERT `to the agora` (100 TIMES `the counselling rate` `a permanent licence` `the example's counsellor`) EQUALS 7.97
#ASSERT `to the agora` (14.16 TIMES 9 DIVIDED BY 16) EQUALS 7.97

