§ `כה. הסכם השכר במגזר הציבורי`

-- akn:part_25 The heading of part Y (the public-sector wage agreement); its article follows.

§§ `76 עדכון השכר "הישן" בעקבות הסכם השכר במגזר הציבורי`

-- (א)–(ב): subject to a general public-sector wage agreement, the old
-- combined-salary table and the teachers' shekel supplements, as they were
-- on the eve of the signing, are raised in the salary of January 2008 by
-- 1.5%, in that of December 2008 to 3% in all, and in that of January 2010
-- to 5% in all.
@ref akn:art_76 akn:art_76__para_a akn:art_76__para_b akn:art_76__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_76__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_76__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the update of the old salary` m IS
    BRANCH IF m AT LEAST `the salary month` 2010 1 THEN 5%
           IF m AT LEAST `the salary month` 2008 12 THEN 3%
           IF m AT LEAST `the salary month` 2008 1 THEN 1.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT `the update of the old salary` (`the salary month` 2008 11) EQUALS 1.5%
#ASSERT `the update of the old salary` (`the salary month` 2008 12) EQUALS 3%

-- (ג): where the general agreement signed sets other rates or dates, those
-- of (ב) follow it. The general public-sector wage agreement is the
-- framework agreement of 17.4.2008 (imported), and its rates and dates are
-- those of its cost frame, which (א) applies to the salary (convention
-- instruments.general-wage-agreement): 1.5% from 1.1.2008, 3% from
-- 1.12.2008 and 5% from 1.12.2009 — so (ב)(3)'s completion to 5% moves from
-- the salary of January 2010 to that of December 2009. "Different" goes
-- both ways: (ב) follows the frame where it is higher or lower.
@ref akn:art_76__para_c
GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the old salary's update as corrected` m IS
    `the 2008 framework cost frame in the salary month` m

-- The founding agreement and its round: (ב) as printed gives the same
-- rates at the same dates but the last, which it gives a month after the
-- framework; (ג) closes that month, and the old salary as corrected never
-- lags the framework's frame.
#ASSERT `the update of the old salary` (`the salary month` 2009 12) EQUALS 3%
#ASSERT `the old salary's update as corrected` (`the salary month` 2009 12) EQUALS 5%
#ASSERT all (GIVEN m YIELD `the old salary's update as corrected` m EQUALS `the update of the old salary` m)
            (LIST `the salary month` 2007 12, `the salary month` 2008 1, `the salary month` 2008 11,
                  `the salary month` 2008 12, `the salary month` 2009 11, `the salary month` 2010 1, `the salary month` 2012 6)
#ASSERT `X as it will be in the salary month` 7000 (`the salary month` 2009 12) EQUALS 7350

