§§ `77 הפסקת איחוד משכורות ("הסכם שאילה והשאלה")`

DECLARE `consolidation case` IS ONE OF
    `a new teaching employee`
    `an existing employee it did not apply to in 5767`
    `an employee it applied to in 5767`

-- (א): from 5768 the salary-consolidation agreement ("borrowing and
-- lending", not encoded) does not apply to a new teaching employee; (ב):
-- the State's demand that it not apply to an existing one it did not apply
-- to in 5767 is left to the comprehensive agreement.
@ref akn:art_77 akn:art_77__para_a akn:art_77__para_b
GIVEN c IS A `consolidation case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the consolidation agreement stops applying from 5768 to` c IF
    c EQUALS `a new teaching employee`

-- (ג): for one it applied to in 5767 — employed by the State, paid in full
-- by it, lent to an owner to teach: (1) until he moves to the reform, the
-- consolidation agreement applies to his junior-high employment; (2) from
-- the school year he moves, it goes on applying, but his junior-high work
-- for the State is on the reform's terms and his work on loan to the owner
-- on the wage agreements of the eve of the signing, all paid by the State.
@ref akn:art_77__para_c akn:art_77__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_77__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_77__para_c__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_77__para_c__subpara_2/p3
DECLARE `part of a consolidated employment` IS ONE OF
    `junior-high work in the civil service`
    `work on loan to an owner`

GIVEN p IS A `part of a consolidated employment`, `moved to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of employment`
DECIDE `the terms of a consolidated part` p `moved to the reform` IS
    IF `moved to the reform` AND p EQUALS `junior-high work in the civil service`
    THEN `the reform's terms`
    ELSE `the existing agreements`

§ `כז. משכורת קובעת בפנסיה תקציבית`

-- akn:part_27 The heading of part AA (the determining salary of a budgetary pension); its article follows.

§§ `78 משכורת קובעת של עובדי הוראה קיימים`

-- (א) ¶1–¶5: for a teaching employee in a budgetary pension who served
-- under the pre-reform agreements and moved to the reform: A, the service
-- before the move; B, the service from it; C = A + B, service as the
-- pensions law (חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות), 1970; not encoded) counts it.
-- ¶6–¶7 and (1)–(4): X, the determining salary under §8 of that law on the
-- eve of the move, updated by the raises given to all the reform's
-- teachers, with the seniority at retirement, an allowance that ended
-- counted if its conditions held at the move, a management, counselling or
-- instruction allowance paid on the eve counted if its conditions were
-- completed after the move, and an allowance that went on counted at its
-- rate on the eve if its conditions hold at retirement. ¶8: a simpler way
-- to compute X is to be examined; ¶9: Y, the determining salary under §8 at
-- retirement; ¶10: of §29's allowances, only those in the determining
-- salary on the eve. ¶11–¶13: Z = (X × A + Y × B) / C.
@ref akn:art_78 akn:art_78__para_a akn:art_78__para_a/p2 akn:art_78__para_a/p3 akn:art_78__para_a/p4 akn:art_78__para_a/p5 akn:art_78__para_a/p6 akn:art_78__para_a/p7 akn:art_78__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_78__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_78__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_78__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_78__para_a/p8 akn:art_78__para_a/p9 akn:art_78__para_a/p10 akn:art_78__para_a/p11 akn:art_78__para_a/p12 akn:art_78__para_a/p13
GIVEN `X, the determining salary of the eve, updated` IS A NUMBER @desc under §8 of the pensions law, by the rules of (1)–(4)
      `Y, the determining salary at retirement` IS A NUMBER @desc under §8 of the pensions law
      `A, service before the move` IS A NUMBER
      `B, service from the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Z, the determining salary` `X, the determining salary of the eve, updated` `Y, the determining salary at retirement` `A, service before the move` `B, service from the move` IS
    IF `A, service before the move` PLUS `B, service from the move` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN (    `X, the determining salary of the eve, updated` TIMES `A, service before the move`
          PLUS `Y, the determining salary at retirement` TIMES `B, service from the move`)
         DIVIDED BY (`A, service before the move` PLUS `B, service from the move`)
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `Z, the determining salary` 9000 12000 20 10 EQUALS 10000

DECLARE `kind of allowance at retirement` IS ONE OF
    `an allowance that ended with the reform`
    `a management, counselling or instruction allowance paid on the eve`
    `an allowance that went on under the reform`

GIVEN k IS A `kind of allowance at retirement`
      `its conditions held at the move` IS A BOOLEAN
      `its conditions were completed after the move` IS A BOOLEAN
      `its conditions hold at retirement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the determining salary on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counted in X` k `its conditions held at the move` `its conditions were completed after the move` `its conditions hold at retirement` `in the determining salary on the eve` IF
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `an allowance that ended with the reform` THEN `its conditions held at the move`
    WHEN `a management, counselling or instruction allowance paid on the eve` THEN `its conditions held at the move` OR `its conditions were completed after the move`
    WHEN `an allowance that went on under the reform` THEN `its conditions hold at retirement` AND `in the determining salary on the eve`

DECLARE `pension action` IS ONE OF
    `support the legislation section 78 needs`

-- (ב): the union will support the legislation the section needs.
@ref akn:art_78__para_b
`supporting the pension legislation` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `support the legislation section 78 needs`

§ `כח. שכר פנסיוני לעובדי הוראה המבוטחים בפנסיה צוברת`

-- akn:part_28 The heading of part BB (pensionable pay of those in an accrual pension); its article follows.
-- akn:art_79 Left to the negotiation of the comprehensive agreement; no rule.

§ `כט. שעון נוכחות בשנת הלימודים תשס"ח`

-- akn:part_29 The heading of part CC (the attendance clock in 5768); its article follows.

§§ `80`

DECLARE `attendance action` IS ONE OF
    `clock in and out on the school's computerised attendance clock`

-- ¶1: in 5768, in every school the reform comes to in 5768, the teaching
-- employees clock in and out on a computerised clock installed in the
-- school, by rules the Ministry sets; ¶2: the details are left to the
-- comprehensive agreement.
@ref akn:art_80 akn:art_80/p2
`clocking attendance in 5768` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `clock in and out on the school's computerised attendance clock`

GIVEN `the reform came to the school in 5768` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 80 applies in 5768` `the reform came to the school in 5768` IF
    `the reform came to the school in 5768`

§ `ל. הסכמים קודמים`

-- akn:part_30 The heading of part DD (earlier agreements); its article follows.

§§ `81`

-- akn:art_81 The article's number line; (א)–(ג) follow.

DECLARE `matter` IS ONE OF
    `pay and the structure of employment`
    `the erosion check against the engineers' pay`
    `a matter this agreement does not settle`

-- (א): for teachers on the reform's terms, this agreement replaces the
-- agreements and arrangements of the eve of the signing on pay and the
-- structure of employment, unless it says otherwise; the parties will
-- adjust what rested on the old week. (ב): the agreements' provisions on
-- checking the erosion of teachers' pay against engineers' do not apply to
-- teachers on the reform's terms — in two schools, only to the reform
-- employment. (ג): every agreement, arrangement and practice in force on
-- 1.9.07 (as since updated) on a matter this agreement does not settle,
-- and that it does not expressly change, stays as it was until 1.9.07; to
-- be completed in the comprehensive agreement.
@ref akn:art_81__para_a akn:art_81__para_b akn:art_81__para_b/p2 akn:art_81__para_c
GIVEN m IS A `matter`, `the employment is on the reform's terms` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the earlier agreements govern` m `the employment is on the reform's terms` IF
        (NOT `the employment is on the reform's terms`)
    OR  m EQUALS `a matter this agreement does not settle`

#ASSERT NOT `the earlier agreements govern` `the erosion check against the engineers' pay` TRUE
#ASSERT `the earlier agreements govern` `the erosion check against the engineers' pay` FALSE

§ `לא. מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

-- akn:part_31 The heading of part EE (exhaustion of claims and industrial peace); its articles follow.
-- akn:art_82 Exhaustion of claims: left to the comprehensive agreement; no rule.

§§ `83 שקט תעשייתי`

DECLARE `claim action` IS ONE OF
    `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`

-- §83: until 15.12.07, or the day the agreement is extended to, neither
-- party, nor a unit of it, strikes or locks out, wholly or partly, or
-- otherwise disrupts work in an organised way, over a matter it settles.
@ref akn:art_83 akn:art_83/p1
`days of the industrial peace from the signing` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL `15 December 2007` MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing date`

`industrial peace` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`
     WITHIN `days of the industrial peace from the signing`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter this agreement settles`
     WITHIN `days of the industrial peace from the signing`)

#ASSERT `days of the industrial peace from the signing` EQUALS 96

§ `לב. הוראות כלליות לעניין הסכם זה`

-- akn:part_32 The heading of part FF (general provisions of the agreement); its articles follow.

§§ `84`

-- §84: the agreement, save §§83–90, comes into force when the amendment of
-- the pensions law that §78 needs does, and is then in force back to
-- 1.9.07; §§83–90 are in force from the signing.
-- F-ofek-hadash-founding-2007-s: §91, the supreme follow-up committee that
-- decides the steering committee's disputes (§91(א)), is not among them:
-- until the law is amended, §90's committee is in force and the one that
-- resolves its disagreements is not. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.as-printed): §91 waits for the law, as printed.
@ref akn:art_84
GIVEN article IS A NUMBER, `the pensions amendment is in force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the article is in force` article `the pensions amendment is in force` IF
    `the pensions amendment is in force` OR (article AT LEAST 83 AND article AT MOST 90)

`the steering committee stands and the committee deciding its disputes waits` MEANS
        `the article is in force` 90 FALSE
    AND NOT `the article is in force` 91 FALSE
#ASSERT `the steering committee stands and the committee deciding its disputes waits`

`the agreement is in force back to` MEANS `1 September 2007`

§§ `85`

-- ¶1: if no comprehensive agreement is signed by 15.12.07 and the
-- agreement is not extended by consent, the parties give notice that it
-- ends on 16.12.07, and from then it lapses, collectively and personally.
-- ¶2: the teachers on the reform's terms then go back to every agreement,
-- arrangement and practice the agreement changed, as since updated.
@ref akn:art_85 akn:art_85/p2
GIVEN `comprehensive agreement signed by 15.12.07` IS A BOOLEAN, `extended by consent` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement has lapsed on` `comprehensive agreement signed by 15.12.07` `extended by consent` d IF
        (NOT (`comprehensive agreement signed by 15.12.07` OR `extended by consent`))
    AND d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 16 12 2007)

#ASSERT `the agreement has lapsed on` FALSE FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 16 12 2007)
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement has lapsed on` FALSE TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008)
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement has lapsed on` FALSE FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2007)

GIVEN `the agreement has lapsed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `terms of employment`
DECIDE `the terms of a reform teacher` `the agreement has lapsed` IS
    IF `the agreement has lapsed` THEN `the existing agreements` ELSE `the reform's terms`

-- akn:art_86 Each party keeps further issues for the comprehensive agreement's negotiation; no rule.

§ `לג. הוראות מעבר`

-- akn:part_33 The heading of part GG (transitional provisions); its articles follow.

§§ `87`

DECLARE `declaration action` IS ONE OF
    `sign the declaration of annex טו'`

-- ¶1: from 1.9.07 to the day the agreement comes into force (§84) or to
-- 15.12.07, whichever is earlier, a teaching employee in a school on the
-- Ministry's list (§5) who asks to move to the reform signs a declaration:
-- (א) he asks to move; (ב) he agrees to the pay of this agreement against
-- all the duties of the reform; (ג) it was made clear to him that what he
-- is paid above the determining salary he would have had off the reform
-- ("ההפרש") is a payment for work beyond his position, not salary for any
-- purpose, with no contributions on it, and that the government intends a
-- bill computing the determining salary of a budgetary pension by two
-- periods; (ד) that the agreement's provisions are interlinked. ¶2: the
-- declaration's wording is annex טו' (not in this document).
@ref akn:art_87 akn:art_87__para_a akn:art_87__para_b akn:art_87__para_d akn:art_87/p2
GIVEN `the agreement came into force on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the transitional period ends on` `the agreement came into force on` IS
    CONSIDER `the agreement came into force on`
    WHEN JUST d THEN (IF d `is on or before` `15 December 2007` THEN d ELSE `15 December 2007`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `15 December 2007`

`the transitional declaration` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `sign the declaration of annex טו'`

@ref akn:art_87__para_c
GIVEN `pay under the reform` IS A NUMBER, `the determining salary off the reform` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference paid for work beyond the position` `pay under the reform` `the determining salary off the reform` IS
    `not below zero` (`pay under the reform` MINUS `the determining salary off the reform`)

`the difference is salary for any purpose` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `the transitional period ends on` NOTHING EQUALS `15 December 2007`
#ASSERT `the difference paid for work beyond the position` 8190 7000 EQUALS 1190

§§ `88`

DECLARE `wage agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `sign a wage agreement paying the raises of section 76`

-- §88: even with no comprehensive agreement by 15.12.2007 or its extended
-- day, once the general public-sector wage agreement is signed the union
-- and the State sign a wage agreement paying the teachers the raises, at
-- the rates and dates, of §76.
@ref akn:art_88
`the wage agreement after the general one` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `sign a wage agreement paying the raises of section 76`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `sign a wage agreement paying the raises of section 76`)

§§ `89 שקיפות`

DECLARE `transparency action` IS ONE OF
    `give the union the information it needs that the law allows to be given`

-- §89: the State acts in full transparency over every piece of
-- information the law allows to be given and the union needs to carry out,
-- follow or negotiate the agreement.
@ref akn:art_89 akn:art_89/p1
`transparency` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `give the union the information it needs that the law allows to be given`

§ `לד. יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- akn:part_34 The heading of part HH (settling disputes); its articles follow.

§§ `90 ועדת היגוי`

-- (א)–(ג): a parity steering committee helps interpret and apply the
-- agreement — representatives of the Treasury's wages division, the
-- Ministry and the union — and decides unanimously.
@ref akn:art_90 akn:art_90__para_a akn:art_90__para_b akn:art_90__para_c
GIVEN votes IS A LIST OF BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a committee decides` votes IF
    count votes GREATER THAN 0 AND all (GIVEN v YIELD v) votes

#ASSERT NOT `a committee decides` (LIST TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)

§§ `91 ועדת מעקב עליונה`

DECLARE `dispute action` IS ONE OF
    `take the steps the law allows`

-- (א)–(ג): disagreements in the steering committee on the agreement's
-- interpretation or application are decided by the supreme follow-up
-- committee — the wages commissioner, the Ministry's Director-General and
-- the union's general secretary, a parity committee — unanimously. (ד):
-- where it does not decide, each party may take the steps the law allows.
@ref akn:art_91 akn:art_91__para_a akn:art_91__para_b akn:art_91__para_c
GIVEN `the steering committee decided` IS A BOOLEAN, `the supreme committee's votes` IS A LIST OF BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the dispute is decided` `the steering committee decided` `the supreme committee's votes` IF
    `the steering committee decided` OR `a committee decides` `the supreme committee's votes`

@ref akn:art_91__para_d
`each party's lawful steps` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MAY   `take the steps the law allows`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MAY   `take the steps the law allows`)

